INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('lips85/antigravity-skills-bootstrap/kaizen', 'kaizen', 'lips85', 'antigravity-skills-bootstrap', 'community', 'kaizen lips85 antigravity-skills-bootstrap community Kaizen is a skill that helps developers apply continuous improvement to their code implementation, architecture, and workflows. It prevents errors at design time, ensuring quality through incremental progress. Kaizen是一种持续改进的方法，通过小步骤的改进来实现质量的提升 Kaizenは継続的改善の手法で、小さな改善の積み重ねによって品質を高める Kaizen은 지속적인 개선의 방법으로, 작은 단계의 개선을 통해 품질을 향상시킵니다 Kaizen es una filosofía de mejora continua que se aplica a la implementación de código, arquitectura y diseño de procesos. Mejora tu código con pequeñas mejoras continuas Kaizen est une philosophie d''amélioration continue qui s''applique à la mise en œuvre de code, d''architecture et de conception de processus. Améliorez votre code avec de petites améliorations continues Kaizen ist eine Philosophie der kontinuierlichen Verbesserung, die auf die Implementierung von Code, Architektur und Prozessdesign anwendbar ist. Verbessern Sie Ihren Code mit kleinen, kontinuierlichen Verbesserungen O Kaizen é uma abordagem de melhoria contínua que se concentra em pequenas mudanças incrementais para melhorar a qualidade e reduzir erros Kaizen - это подход к непрерывному улучшению, который фокусируется на небольших инкрементальных изменениях для улучшения качества и снижения ошибок Kaizen هو نهج لتحسين مستمر يركز على تحسينات صغيرة ومستمرة لتحسين الجودة وتقليل الأخطاء what is kaizen how to use kaizen kaizen setup guide kaizen alternative kaizen vs agile kaizen install continuous improvement methodology error-proof design npx-based bootstrapper Kaizen 持续改进 AI工具 代码优化 架构设计 错误预防 软件开发方法 Applies to code implementation and refactoring Guides architecture and design decisions Improves process and workflow efficiency Enhances error handling and validation Follows the principle of many small improvements over one big change Kaizen is a philosophy that emphasizes small, continuous improvements to achieve quality and prevent errors, guiding code implementation, architecture, and workflow decisions.');
