INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ducnm-mimhus/Avada-Simple-Sales-Pop/theme-extension', 'theme-extension', 'ducnm-mimhus', 'Avada-Simple-Sales-Pop', 'community', 'theme-extension ducnm-mimhus Avada-Simple-Sales-Pop community The theme-extension skill utilizes Shopify''s native Liquid rendering for optimal storefront performance, benefiting developers who need to render static/semi-static content and SEO-critical product displays. 主题扩展开发使用Shopify的原生Liquid渲染技术，优化店面性能。适用于静态/半静态内容、SEO关键内容和产品展示。 テーマエクステンション開発は、ShopifyのネイティブLiquidレンダリングを使用してストアのパフォーマンスを最適化します。静的/半静的コンテンツ、SEO关键コンテンツ、製品表示に適しています。 테마 확장 개발은 Shopify의 네이티브 Liquid 렌더링을 사용하여 상점 성능을 최적화합니다. 정적/반정적 콘텐츠, SEO关键 콘텐츠, 제품 표시에 적합합니다. Las extensiones de tema utilizan la renderización nativa de Liquid de Shopify para un rendimiento óptimo en la tienda en línea Les extensions de thème utilisent le rendu Liquid natif de Shopify pour un rendement optimal sur le site de commerce électronique Theme-Extensions verwenden die native Liquid-Renderung von Shopify für ein optimales Leistung in dem Online-Shop Desenvolva extensões de tema para melhorar o desempenho da loja virtual com renderização Liquid nativa do Shopify. Разработайте расширения темы для увеличения скорости магазина с помощью родной Liquid-рендеринга Shopify. طور ملحقات قوالب لتطوير أداء المتجر الإلكتروني باستخدام تقنية Liquid الأصلية من Shopify. how to use theme-extension what is theme-extension theme-extension alternative theme-extension vs scripttag theme-extension install theme-extension setup guide shopify liquid rendering optimal storefront performance 主题扩展开发 Shopify Liquid 商店性能优化 静态内容开发 SEO关键内容开发 产品展示开发 服务器端渲染 AIエージェント Utilizes Shopify''s native Liquid rendering for optimal storefront performance Supports server-rendered content for static/semi-static and SEO-critical product displays Follows a specific directory structure for theme extension development Allows for static and semi-static content rendering Enables SEO-critical content rendering for product displays Uses a theme extension approach for optimal performance theme-extension is a development approach that uses Shopify''s native Liquid rendering for server-rendered content, ensuring optimal storefront performance.');
