de experimentos","fr":"Analyze-experiment est un outil de recherche sociale qui utilise les LLM pour visualiser et analyser les résultats d''expériences","de":"Analyze-experiment ist ein Tool für soziale Forschung, das LLM verwendet, um Ergebnisse von Experimenten zu visualisieren und zu analysieren","pt":"O que é analyze-experiment? É uma ferramenta para visualizar e analisar resultados de experimentos com LLMs.","ru":"Что такое analyze-experiment? Это инструмент для визуализации и анализа результатов экспериментов с LLMs.","ar":"ما هو analyze-experiment؟ هو أداة لتصور و تحليل نتائج التجارب مع LLMs."},"features":{"en":["Generates interactive HTML plots using inspect-viz","Loads evaluation logs from run directories","Infers appropriate visualization types based on experimental variables","Reads experiment design from experiment_summary.yaml files","Logs the process in log files"],"zh":["生成交互式HTML图表","生成PNG图表","使用inspect-viz预建视图","读取experiment_summary.yaml文件","加载evaluation日志"],"ja":["インタラクティブなHTMLグラフを生成","PNGグラフを生成","inspect-vizの事前ビルドビューを使用","experiment_summary.yamlファイルを読み取り","評価ログを読み込み"],"ko":["인터랙티브 HTML 그래프 생성","PNG 그래프 생성","inspect-viz의 사전 빌드 보기 사용","experiment_summary.yaml 파일 읽기","평가 로그 로딩"],"es":["Generación de visualizaciones interactivas con inspect-viz","Carga de registros de evaluación desde directorios de ejecución","Inferencia de tipos de visualización adecuados según variables experimentales","Generación de gráficos PNG y HTML interactivos","Registro del proceso en logs"],"fr":["Génération de visualisations interactives avec inspect-viz","Chargement des journaux d''évaluation à partir de répertoires d''exécution","Inférence de types de visualisation appropriés en fonction de variables expérimentales","Génération de graphiques PNG et HTML interactifs","Enregistrement du processus dans les journaux"],"de":["Erzeugung interaktiver Visualisierungen mit inspect-viz","Laden von Bewertungsprotokollen aus Ausführungsverzeichnissen","Ableitung geeigneter Visualisierungstypen basierend auf experimentellen Variablen","Erzeugung interaktiver PNG- und HTML-Graphiken","Protokollierung des Prozesses in Protokollen"],"pt":["Geração de visualizações interativas com inspect-viz","Leitura de arquivos experiment_summary.yaml","Carregamento de logs de avaliação de diretórios de execução","Inferência de tipos de visualização adequados com base em variáveis experimentais","Geração de tramas HTML interativas","Registro do processo em logs"],"ru":["Генерация интерактивных визуализаций с inspect-viz","Чтение файлов experiment_summary.yaml","Загрузка логов оценки из директорий запуска","Выделение подходящих типов визуализаций на основе экспериментальных переменных","Генерация интерактивных HTML-графиков","Регистрация процесса в логах"],"ar":["إنشاء تصورات تفاعلية مع inspect-viz","قراءة ملفات experiment_summary.yaml","تحميل سجلات التقييم من مجلدات التشغيل","استنتاج أنواع التصورات المناسبة بناءً على متغيرات التجربة","إنشاء مخططات HTML تفاعلية","تسجيل العملية في السجلات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use analyze-experiment","what is analyze-experiment","analyze-experiment alternative","analyze-experiment vs inspect-viz","analyze-experiment install","analyze-experiment setup guide","LLM research tools","social research analysis"],"zh":["analyze-experiment","可视化工具","实验结果分析","inspect-viz","实验设计","评估日志"],"ja":["analyze-experiment","AIエージェント","実験結果分析","inspect-viz","実験設計","評価ログ"],"ko":["analyze-experiment","실험 분석 도구","실험 결과 시각화","inspect-viz","실험 설계","평가 로그"],"es":["herramientas de investigación social","LLM","visualización de resultados","análisis de experimentos","inspect-viz","generación de gráficos","registro de proceso","experimentos con LLM","análisis de datos con LLM"],"fr":["outils de recherche sociale","LLM","visualisation de résultats","analyse d''expériences","inspect-viz","génération de graphiques","enregistrement de processus","expériences avec LLM","analyse de données avec LLM"],"de":["Tools für soziale Forschung","LLM","Visualisierung von Ergebnissen","Analyse von Experimenten","inspect-viz","Erzeugung von Graphiken","Protokollierung von Prozessen","Experimente mit LLM","Datenanalyse mit LLM"],"pt":["analyze-experiment","ferramentas de pesquisa social","LLMs","inspect-viz","visualização de dados","análise de experimentos","desenvolvimento de software","IA","inteligência artificial"],"ru":["analyze-experiment","ИИ Агенты","инструменты социальных исследований","LLMs","inspect-viz","визуализация данных","анализ экспериментов","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ","искусственный интеллект"],"ar":["analyze-experiment","أدوات البحث الاجتماعي","LLMs","inspect-viz","تصوير البيانات","تحليل التجارب","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي","IA","بحث علمي"]}},"owner":"niznik-dev","repo":"cruijff_kit","repoPath":"niznik-dev/cruijff_kit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"analyze-experiment","description":"Generate visualizations from completed experiment evaluations using inspect-viz. Use after run-experiment to create interactive HTML plots from inspect-ai evaluation logs.","bodyPreview":"# Analyze Experiment\n\nYou help users visualize and analyze results from completed experiments by generating interactive HTML and PNG plots using inspect-viz pre-built views.\n\n## Your Task\n\nGenerate visualizations from evaluation results:\n\n1. Read experiment_summary.yaml to understand experimental design\n2. Load evaluation logs from run directories\n3. Infer appropriate visualization types based on experimental variables\n4. Generate interactive HTML plots using inspect-viz\n5. Log the process in lo","body":"# Analyze Experiment\n\nYou help users visualize and analyze results from completed experiments by generating interactive HTML and PNG plots using inspect-viz pre-built views.\n\n## Your Task\n\nGenerate visualizations from evaluation results:\n\n1. Read experiment_summary.yaml to understand experimental design\n2. Load evaluation logs from run directories\n3. Infer appropriate visualization types based on experimental variables\n4. Generate interactive HTML plots using inspect-viz\n5. Log the process in logs/analyze-experiment.log\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- experiment_summary.yaml exists (from design-experiment)\n- Evaluations complete (from run-experiment)\n- inspect-viz installed (`pip install inspect-viz`)\n- Conda environment activated (from claude.local.md)\n- **Optional:** playwright for PNG export (`pip install playwright && playwright install chromium`)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Locate Experiment → `parsing.md`\n\nFind experiment directory and parse experiment_summary.yaml for:\n- Experimental variables (model, task, factors)\n- Run structure and naming conventions\n- Evaluation matrix\n\n**See `parsing.md` for:**\n- How to find the experiment directory\n- YAML parsing logic\n- Extracting variable types for inference\n\n### 2. Load Evaluation Logs → `data_loading.md`\n\nUse helper functions from `tools/inspect/viz_helpers.py`:\n- `deduplicate_eval_files()` - Remove duplicate evals (keeps most recent per model+epoch)\n- `evals_df_prep()` - Prepare eval-level dataframes\n- `parse_eval_metadata()` - Extract epoch/finetuned/source_model from JSON metadata\n- `detect_metrics()` - Dynamically detect available score columns\n\n**See `data_loading.md` for:**\n- Automatic deduplication of re-run evaluations\n- Generic metadata extraction using vis_label and JSON metadata\n- How to construct subdirs list from experiment_summary.yaml\n- Preparing data for each view type\n\n### 3. Select Visualizations\n\nMap experimental variables to appropriate pre-built views:\n\n| Variable Type | View |\n|---------------|------|\n| Multiple models | `scores_by_model` |\n| Binary factor | `scores_by_factor` |\n| Multiple tasks/conditions | `scores_by_task` |\n| Model × task matrix | `scores_heatmap` |\n| Multiple metrics | `scores_radar_by_task` |\n\n### 4. Generate Plots → `generation.md`\n\nCreate visualizations using inspect-viz:\n1. Wrap dataframes with `Data.from_dataframe()`\n2. Call appropriate pre-built view functions\n3. Save HTML with `write_html()`\n4. Auto-export PNG with `write_png()` if playwright is available\n\n**See `generation.md` for:**\n- Dynamic metric detection\n- View function signatures and parameters\n- PNG export with playwright auto-detection\n- Output file naming conventions\n- Creating multiple plots per experiment\n\n### 5. Generate Analysis & Interpretation → `generation.md`\n\n**This step is required by default.** Write a `future_directions` string that interprets the results and suggests next steps. This section should:\n\n1. Interpret the key findings (what do the metrics mean for the research question?)\n2. Note any surprises or anomalies in the results\n3. Suggest concrete next experiments or analyses\n\nOnly omit this section if the user explicitly asks to skip it.\n\n### 6. Generate Report → `generation.md`\n\nCreate markdown report with metrics and comparisons:\n1. Extract metrics from evaluation dataframe\n2. Compute Wilson score confidence intervals\n3. Generate narrative summary and comparison tables\n4. Include `future_directions` from step 5\n5. Write report to `analysis/report.md`\n\nUses `tools/inspect/report_generator.py`:\n```python\nfrom tools.inspect.report_generator import generate_report\n\nreport = generate_report(\n    df=logs_df,\n    experiment_name=experiment_name,\n    output_path=Path(experiment_dir) / \"analysis\" / \"report.md\",\n    config=experiment_config,  # Optional, for research question metadata\n    future_directions=future_directions,  # From step 5\n)\n```\n\n### 6b. Compute Utilization Report → `generation.md`\n\nIf run logs exist (`logs/run-torchtune.log` and/or `logs/run-inspect.log`), generate a compute utilization section:\n\n1. Extract job IDs from logs (regex: `Result: Job ID (\\d+)`)\n2. Run `seff` for each job and parse with `tools/slurm/compute_metrics.py`\n3. Read `gpu_metrics.csv` files and summarize with `summarize_gpu_metrics()`\n4. Generate compute table with `format_compute_table()`\n5. Save raw metrics to `analysis/compute_metrics.json`\n6. Pass formatted table as `compute_section` to `generate_report()`\n\n**Skip silently** if no run logs exist (e.g., analyzing results without having run the experiment locally).\n\n### 7. Logging → `logging.md`\n\nDocument process in `{experiment_dir}/logs/analyze-experiment.log`\n\n**See `logging.md` for:**\n- JSONL format specification\n- Action types (LOCATE, PARSE, LOAD, INFER, GENERATE)\n- Example log entries\n\n---\n\n## Supported Pre-built Views\n\n| View | Use Case | Required Data |\n|------|----------|---------------|\n| `scores_by_task` | Multiple tasks/conditions | task_name column |\n| `scores_heatmap` | Model × task matrix | model + task columns |\n| `scores_radar_by_task` | Multiple metrics | Multiple score columns |\n| `scores_by_factor` | Binary factors | Boolean factor column |\n| `scores_by_model` | Cross-model comparison (single task only) | model column, single task |\n\n**Note:** `scores_by_model` requires a single-task experiment. For multi-task experiments, use `scores_by_task`, `scores_heatmap`, or `scores_radar_by_task` instead.\n\n## User Questions\n\n### Existing Analysis Outputs\n\nIf `analysis/` directory exists with files, **ask the user**:\n\n```\nFound existing analysis outputs in analysis/. What would you like to do?\n\n1. Keep existing files, add new outputs (Recommended)\n2. Clean analysis directory first\n```\n\nIf user chooses option 2, delete contents of `analysis/` before generating new outputs.\n\n### Visualization Selection\n\nWhen `vis_label` creates multiple task variants (conditions), **ask the user** which visualization to generate:\n\n```\nFound {N} conditions via vis_label: {list}\n\nWhich visualization would you like?\n\n1. scores_by_task - Compare conditions side-by-side (Recommended)\n2. scores_heatmap - Model × condition matrix\n3. Both\n```\n\n### Tracking Generated Files\n\n**Important:** Track which PNG files you generate during this run. Only pass those to `generate_report()` so the report embeds only the visualizations created in this session, not stale outputs from previous runs.\n\n```python\ngenerated_pngs = []\n\n# After each successful PNG export\ngenerated_pngs.append(png_path)\n\n# Pass to report generator\ngenerate_report(..., generated_pngs=generated_pngs)\n```\n\n**Smart defaults for everything else:**\n- Deduplication: Automatic (keep most recent per model+epoch)\n- Epochs: Use latest only (unless user explicitly asks for all)\n- Metrics: Plot all available (dynamically detected)\n- PNG: Auto-detect playwright; generate if available, skip with warning if not\n\n## Output Structure\n\nAfter running, the experiment directory will contain:\n\n```\n{experiment_dir}/\n├── analysis/\n│   ├── report.md               # Markdown report with metrics\n│   ├── scores_by_task.html\n│   ├── scores_by_task.png      (if playwright available)\n│   ├── scores_heatmap.html\n│   ├── scores_heatmap.png      (if playwright available)\n│   ├── roc_curves.png          (if risk_scorer used)\n│   ├── calibration_curves.png  (if risk_scorer used)\n│   ├── prediction_histogram.png (if risk_scorer used)\n│   └── ...\n├── logs/\n│   └── analyze-experiment.log\n└── experiment_summary.yaml\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\n**If experiment_summary.yaml not found:**\n- Report error to user\n- Suggest running design-experiment skill first\n- Do not proceed\n\n**If no evaluation logs found:**\n- Report error to user\n- Suggest running run-experiment skill first\n- Do not proceed\n\n**If visualization generation fails:**\n- Log error details in analyze-experiment.log\n- Continue with remaining visualizations\n- Report which visualizations failed in summary\n\n**If inference cannot determine view type:**\n- Log warning\n- Ask user which view to generate\n- Or skip and note in summary\n\n## Validation Before Completion\n\nBefore reporting success, verify:\n- ✓ experiment_summary.yaml was found and parsed\n- ✓ Evaluation logs were loaded successfully\n- ✓ At least one visualization was generated\n- ✓ HTML files exist in analysis/ directory\n- ✓ report.md was generated in analysis/ directory\n- ✓ Log file created (logs/analyze-experiment.log)\n\n## Output Summary\n\nAfter completing analysis, provide a summary:\n\n```markdown\n## Analyze Experiment Complete\n\nExperiment: `{experiment_dir}`\n\n### Report Generated\n\n✓ Markdown report: `analysis/report.md`\n  - Executive summary with best performer\n  - Model comparison table with 95% CIs\n  - Calibration metrics (if available)\n\n### Visualizations Generated\n\n✓ {N} visualizations created in `analysis/`\n\n**Created:**\n- scores_by_task.html - Task comparison (match accuracy)\n- scores_heatmap.html - Model × task matrix\n- scores_by_model.html - Model comparison\n\n### Viewing Results\n\nOpen HTML files in a browser:\n```bash\nopen {experiment_dir}/analysis/scores_by_task.html\n```\n\nOr start a local server:\n```bash\ncd {experiment_dir}/analysis && python -m http.server 8080\n```\n\n### Log\n\nDetails recorded in `logs/analyze-experiment.log`\n\n### Report Path\n\n`{experiment_dir}/analysis/report.md`\n```\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Always end your output summary with the **full absolute path** to `report.md` on its own line, so the user can command-click it in their terminal/IDE. Example:\n\n```\nFull report: /scratch/gpfs/user/ck-experiments/my_experiment/analysis/report.md\n```\n\n## Relationship to Other Skills\n\n- **After:** run-experiment, summarize-experiment\n- **Reads:** experiment_summary.yaml, .eval files\n- **Creates:** HTML visualizations, analysis log\n\n**Workflow position:**\n```\ndesign-experiment → scaffold-experiment → run-experiment → analyze-experiment\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- **Metadata-driven** - uses `vis_label` metadata for task names, JSON metadata for epoch/finetuned/source_model\n- **Automatic deduplication** - when multiple evals exist for the same model+epoch, keeps only the most recent (logs skipped files)\n- **Dynamic metric detection** - plots all available score columns (no hardcoding)\n- **Must run after evaluations complete** - requires .eval files to exist\n- Visualizations are independent - one failing doesn''t stop others\n- Output directory (`analysis/`) is created if it doesn''t exist\n- HTML files are standalone (no external dependencies to view)\n- PNG files require playwright (skipped with warning if not installed)\n- Uses helper functions from `tools/inspect/viz_helpers.py`\n- Reference examples in `viz_examples/scripts/inspect_viz_examples.ipynb`\n\n## Module Organization\n\n| Module | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| parsing.md | Experiment location and YAML parsing |\n| data_loading.md | Helper functions for loading logs |\n| generation.md | Plot creation workflow |\n| logging.md | JSONL audit trail specification |\n\n## Implementation Reference\n\nWorking examples exist in `viz_examples/scripts/inspect_viz_examples.ipynb` demonstrating all supported pre-built views.\n\nHelper functions are implemented in `tools/inspect/viz_helpers.py`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:51.196Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Analysis Agents needing advanced experiment visualization capabilities with inspect-viz and YAML parsing.","zh":"适合需要高级实验可视化能力的数据分析代理，支持inspect-viz和YAML解析。","ja":"データ分析エージェントが高度な実験可視化機能を必要とする場合に適しています。inspect-vizとYAMLパーシングをサポートしています。","ko":"데이터 분석 에이전트가 고급 실험 시각화 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. inspect-viz와 YAML 파싱을 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Datos que necesitan capacidades de visualización de experimentos avanzadas con inspect-viz y análisis de YAML.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Données nécessitant des capacités de visualisation d''expériences avancées avec inspect-viz et analyse YAML.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Experimentvisualisierungsfunktionen mit inspect-viz und YAML-Parsing benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Dados que precisam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de experimentos com inspect-viz e parsing de YAML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа данных, которым требуются расширенные возможности визуализации экспериментов с помощью inspect-viz и парсинга YAML.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل البيانات الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصور التجارب باستخدام inspect-viz و YAML parsing."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate interactive HTML and PNG plots from experiment results using inspect-viz pre-built views, infer visualization types based on experimental variables, and log processes in log files, all while leveraging YAML for experimental design understanding.","zh":"赋予代理生成交互式HTML和PNG图表的能力，使用inspect-viz预建视图，从实验变量中推断可视化类型，并在日志文件中记录过程，同时利用YAML来理解实验设计。","ja":"エージェントに、inspect-vizの事前ビューを使用してインタラクティブなHTMLとPNGプロットを生成し、実験変数に基づいて視覚化タイプを推論し、ログファイルにプロセスを記録する能力を与え、実験設計の理解のためにYAMLを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 인터랙티브 HTML과 PNG 플롯을 생성할 수 있도록 해주며, inspect-viz의 사전 빌드 뷰를 사용하여 실험 결과에서 인터랙티브 HTML 플롯과 PNG 플롯을 생성하고, 실험 변수에 따라 적절한 시각화 유형을 추론하며, 로그 파일에 프로세스를 기록하고, 실험 설계를 이해하기 위해 YAML을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar tramas interactivas HTML y PNG a partir de resultados de experimentos utilizando vistas preestablecidas de inspect-viz, inferir tipos de visualización en función de variables experimentales y registrar procesos en archivos de registro, todo mientras aprovecha YAML para la comprensión del diseño experimental.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des trames interactives HTML et PNG à partir de résultats d''expériences en utilisant des vues préconçues d''inspect-viz, d''inférer des types de visualisation en fonction de variables expérimentales et de consigner les processus dans des fichiers de journal, le tout en exploitant YAML pour la compréhension de la conception expérimentale.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, interaktive HTML- und PNG-Plots aus Experimentsergebnissen zu generieren, indem sie vorgefertigte Ansichten von inspect-viz verwenden, Visualisierungstypen basierend auf experimentellen Variablen abzuleiten und Prozesse in Logdateien zu protokollieren, während sie YAML für das Verständnis des experimentellen Designs nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar gráficos interativos em HTML e PNG a partir de resultados de experimentos usando vistas pré-construídas do inspect-viz, inferir tipos de visualização com base em variáveis experimentais e registrar processos em arquivos de log, tudo isso aproveitando o YAML para compreensão do design experimental.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать интерактивные графики в форматах HTML и PNG из результатов экспериментов с помощью предварительно построенных представлений inspect-viz, выводить типы визуализации на основе экспериментальных переменных и регистрировать процессы в файлах журнала, все это при помощи YAML для понимания конструкции эксперимента.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توليد رسومات تفاعلية في HTML و PNG من نتائج التجارب باستخدام مناظير مسبقة البناء من inspect-viz و استنتاج أنواع التصور بناءً على المتغيرات التجريبية و تسجيل العمليات في سجلات ، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من YAML لفهم تصميم التجربة."},"useCases":{"en":["Visualizing experiment results for researchers and developers","Generating interactive HTML plots for data analysis and presentation","Inferring appropriate visualization types based on experimental variables for automated reporting"],"zh":["为研究人员和开发人员可视化实验结果","为数据分析和演示生成交互式HTML图表","根据实验变量自动推断适当的可视化类型以进行自动报告"],"ja":["研究者と開発者のための実験結果の視覚化","データ分析とプレゼンテーションのためのインタラクティブHTMLプロットの生成","実験変数に基づいて適切な視覚化タイプを自動的に推論して自動報告を行う"],"ko":["연구자와 개발자를 위한 실험 결과 시각화","데이터 분석과 프레젠테이션을 위한 인터랙티브 HTML 플롯 생성","실험 변수에 따라 적절한 시각화 유형을 자동으로 추론하여 자동 보고서 생성"],"es":["Visualización de resultados de experimentos para investigadores y desarrolladores","Generación de tramas interactivas HTML para análisis y presentación de datos","Inferencia de tipos de visualización adecuados en función de variables experimentales para informes automatizados"],"fr":["Visualisation de résultats d''expériences pour les chercheurs et les développeurs","Génération de trames interactives HTML pour l''analyse et la présentation de données","Inférence de types de visualisation appropriés en fonction de variables expérimentales pour la création de rapports automatisés"],"de":["Visualisierung von Experimentsergebnissen für Forscher und Entwickler","Generierung interaktiver HTML-Plots für Datenanalyse und -präsentation","Ableitung geeigneter Visualisierungstypen basierend auf experimentellen Variablen für automatisierte Berichterstellung"],"pt":["Visualizar resultados de experimentos para pesquisadores e desenvolvedores","Gerar gráficos interativos em HTML para análise e apresentação de dados","Inferir tipos de visualização apropriados com base em variáveis experimentais para relatórios automatizados"],"ru":["Визуализация результатов экспериментов для исследователей и разработчиков","Генерация интерактивных графиков в формате HTML для анализа и представления данных","Вывод phù hợp типов визуализации на основе экспериментальных переменных для автоматизированных отчетов"],"ar":["تصور نتائج التجارب للباحثين و المطورين","توليد رسومات تفاعلية في HTML للتحليل و العرض البياني","استنتاج أنواع التصور المناسبة بناءً على المتغيرات التجريبية للتقرير التلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires inspect-viz library","Needs access to experiment_summary.yaml and evaluation logs","Limited to generating HTML and PNG plots"],"zh":["需要inspect-viz库","需要访问experiment_summary.yaml和评估日志","仅限生成HTML和PNG图表"],"ja":["inspect-vizライブラリが必要","experiment_summary.yamlと評価ログへのアクセスが必要","HTMLとPNGプロットの生成のみ"],"ko":["inspect-viz 라이브러리가 필요","experiment_summary.yaml 및 평가 로그에 접근해야 함","HTML 및 PNG 플롯 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca inspect-viz","Necesita acceso a experiment_summary.yaml y registros de evaluación","Limitado a la generación de tramas HTML y PNG"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque inspect-viz","A besoin d''un accès à experiment_summary.yaml et aux journaux d''évaluation","Limité à la génération de trames HTML et PNG"],"de":["Benötigt die inspect-viz-Bibliothek","Benötigt Zugriff auf experiment_summary.yaml und Auswertungsprotokolle","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von HTML- und PNG-Plots"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca inspect-viz","Necessita acesso ao experiment_summary.yaml e logs de avaliação","Limitado a gerar gráficos em HTML e PNG"],"ru":["Требует библиотеки inspect-viz","Требует доступа к experiment_summary.yaml и файлам журнала оценки","Ограничен генерацией графиков только в форматах HTML и PNG"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة inspect-viz","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى experiment_summary.yaml و سجلات التقييم","محدود بتوليد الرسومات في HTML و PNG فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"67f892cf98d08b22b5976c7d2fca6e3d71b6689edb77b0e8484a47e1fc98e3a9","qualityScore":57}');
