넌트 구축","es":"Guía de configuración de frontend con frameworks modernos","fr":"Mise en place de l''interface utilisateur avec des framewo...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Frontend-Entwicklung mit modern...","pt":"Guia de Configuração Frontend: Desenvolvimento de Interfa...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Настройка Фронтенда для Создания Интерфейсов П...","ar":"دليل إعداد الواجهة الأمامية: إنشاء واجهات المستخدم"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to build reusable UI components with atomic design pattern, responsive design, and CSS/Tailwind styling. Get started with frontend development t...","zh":"了解前端开发的最佳实践，包括构建响应式UI组件、状态管理和CSS/Tailwind样式","ja":"モダンなフロントエンド開発のベストプラクティスを学び、レスポンシブなUIコンポーネント、状態管理、CSS/Tailwindスタイルを実装する","ko":"프론트엔드 개발의 최고의 실무를 배우고, 반응형 UI 컴포넌트, 상태 관리, CSS/Tailwind 스타일을 구현하세요","es":"Aprende a implementar interfaces de usuario con frameworks modernos y mejores prácticas para un desarrollo frontend eficiente","fr":"Découvrez comment mettre en place des interfaces utilisateur avec des frameworks frontend modernes pour un développement efficace","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Benutzeroberflächen mit modernen Frameworks und Best Practices für eine effiziente Frontend-Entwicklung implementieren","pt":"Aprenda a criar interfaces de usuário modernas com o agente frontend. Descubra como implementar componentes reutilizáveis e gerenciar estado com tecnologias ...","ru":"Узнайте, как создать современные интерфейсы пользователей с помощью агента фронтенда. Откройте для себя, как реализовать многоразовые компоненты и управлять ...","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إنشاء واجهات مستخدم حديثة مع وكلاء الواجهة الأمامية. اكتشف كيفية تنفيذ مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام وإدارة الحالة باستخدام تقنيات مثل React و..."},"definition":{"en":"Frontend is a set of technologies and techniques used to build user interfaces and user experiences for web applications, utilizing frameworks like React and CSS/Tailwind.","zh":"前端开发是指构建用户界面和用户体验的过程，涉及UI组件、状态管理和样式","ja":"フロントエンド開発は、ユーザーインターフェイスとユーザーエクスペリエンスを構築するプロセスであり、UIコンポーネント、状態管理、スタイルを含みます","ko":"프론트엔드 개발은 사용자 인터페이스와 사용자 경험을 구축하는 과정으로, UI 컴포넌트, 상태 관리, 스타일을 포함합니다","es":"Un agente frontend es un desarrollador que crea interfaces de usuario con frameworks modernos y mejores prácticas","fr":"Un agent frontend est un développeur qui met en place des interfaces utilisateur avec des frameworks modernes et des meilleures pratiques","de":"Ein Frontend-Agent ist ein Entwickler, der Benutzeroberflächen mit modernen Frameworks und Best Practices erstellt","pt":"O que é um agente frontend? É um especialista em desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário que implementa componentes reutilizáveis e gerencia estado.","ru":"Что такое агент фронтенда? Это специалист по созданию интерфейсов пользователя, который реализует многоразовые компоненты и управляет состоянием.","ar":"ما هو وكيل الواجهة الأمامية? هو خبير في إنشاء واجهات المستخدم الذي ينفذ مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام ويدير الحالة."},"features":{"en":["Builds reusable UI components with atomic design pattern","Implements global state management using Zustand, Redux, or Pinia","Adds responsive design and styling with CSS/Tailwind","Supports server state management with React Query or SWR","Creates animations and interactive elements for enhanced user experience"],"zh":["构建可重用UI组件","实现原子设计模式","添加响应式设计","使用CSS/Tailwind样式","实现状态管理（Zustand、Redux、Pinia）","使用React Query和SWR进行服务器状态管理"],"ja":["再利用可能なUIコンポーネントを構築","アトミックデザインパターンを実装","レスポンシブデザインを追加","CSS/Tailwindスタイルを使用","状態管理（Zustand、Redux、Pinia）を実装","React QueryとSWRを使用したサーバー状態管理"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트 구축","원자적 디자인 패턴 구현","반응형 디자인 추가","CSS/Tailwind 스타일 사용","상태 관리（Zustand、Redux、Pinia）구현","React Query와 SWR를 사용한 서버 상태 관리"],"es":["Desarrollo de componentes reutilizables con patrón de diseño atómico","Implementación de gestión de estado global con Zustand, Redux o Pinia","Creación de diseños responsivos con CSS y Tailwind","Adición de animaciones a los componentes","Uso de React Query o SWR para la gestión de estado del servidor"],"fr":["Développement de composants réutilisables avec un modèle de conception atomique","Mise en place d''une gestion d''état global avec Zustand, Redux ou Pinia","Création de conceptions responsives avec CSS et Tailwind","Ajout d''animations aux composants","Utilisation de React Query ou SWR pour la gestion d''état du serveur"],"de":["Entwicklung wiederverwendbarer Komponenten mit atomarem Designmuster","Implementierung der globalen Zustandsverwaltung mit Zustand, Redux oder Pinia","Erstellung responsiver Designs mit CSS und Tailwind","Hinzufügen von Animationen zu den Komponenten","Verwendung von React Query oder SWR für die Zustandsverwaltung des Servers"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de componentes reutilizáveis","Implementação de padrão de design atômico","Criação de layouts de página","Adição de design responsivo","Estilização com CSS e Tailwind","Adição de animações"],"ru":["Разработка многоразовых компонентов","Реализация атомарного паттерна дизайна","Создание макетов страниц","Добавление адаптивного дизайна","Стилизация с помощью CSS и Tailwind","Добавление анимаций"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","تنفيذ نمط تصميم ذري","إنشاء تخطيطات صفحة","إضافة تصميم مستجيب","تلوين باستخدام CSS و Tailwind","إضافة حركات"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use frontend","frontend vs backend","frontend setup guide","what is frontend development","frontend alternative to React","install frontend dependencies","frontend UI component development","frontend state management best practices","frontend CSS/Tailwind styling tutorial"],"zh":["前端开发","UI组件","状态管理","CSS/Tailwind","响应式设计","原子设计模式","Zustand","Redux","Pinia","React Query","SWR"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発","UIコンポーネント","状態管理","CSS/Tailwind","レスポンシブデザイン","アトミックデザインパターン","Zustand","Redux","Pinia","React Query","SWR"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발","UI 컴포넌트","상태 관리","CSS/Tailwind","반응형 디자인","원자적 디자인 패턴","Zustand","Redux","Pinia","React Query","SWR"],"es":["desarrollo frontend","frameworks modernos","componentes reutilizables","gestión de estado","React","Zustand","Redux","Pinia","CSS","Tailwind"],"fr":["développement frontend","frameworks modernes","composants réutilisables","gestion d''état","React","Zustand","Redux","Pinia","CSS","Tailwind"],"de":["Frontend-Entwicklung","moderne Frameworks","wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Zustandsverwaltung","React","Zustand","Redux","Pinia","CSS","Tailwind"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces de usuário","componentes reutilizáveis","gerenciamento de estado","React","Redux","Tailwind","CSS","design responsivo"],"ru":["разработка фронтенда","интерфейсы пользователя","многоразовые компоненты","управление состоянием","React","Redux","Tailwind","CSS","адаптивный дизайн"],"ar":["تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","واجهات المستخدم","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","إدارة الحالة","React","Redux","Tailwind","CSS","تصميم مستجيب"]}},"owner":"mohitmishra786","repo":"aurora-dev","repoPath":"mohitmishra786/aurora-dev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.583Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend","description":"Build UI components, manage state, handle routing, optimize performance, and ensure accessibility","bodyPreview":"## What I Do\n\nI am the **Frontend Agent** - frontend developer and UI builder. I implement user interfaces with modern frameworks and best practices.\n\n### Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Component Development**\n   - Build reusable UI components\n   - Implement atomic design pattern\n   - Create page layouts\n   - Add responsive design\n   - Style with CSS/Tailwind\n   - Add animations\n\n2. **State Management**\n   - Global state (Zustand, Redux, Pinia)\n   - Server state (React Query, SWR)\n   - Local compon","body":"## What I Do\n\nI am the **Frontend Agent** - frontend developer and UI builder. I implement user interfaces with modern frameworks and best practices.\n\n### Core Responsibilities\n\n1. **Component Development**\n   - Build reusable UI components\n   - Implement atomic design pattern\n   - Create page layouts\n   - Add responsive design\n   - Style with CSS/Tailwind\n   - Add animations\n\n2. **State Management**\n   - Global state (Zustand, Redux, Pinia)\n   - Server state (React Query, SWR)\n   - Local component state\n   - Form state handling\n   - State persistence\n\n3. **Routing & Navigation**\n   - Set up route structure\n   - Add protected routes\n   - Implement redirects\n   - Add 404 pages\n   - Route-based code splitting\n   - Route transitions\n\n4. **API Integration**\n   - REST API clients (axios, fetch)\n   - GraphQL clients (Apollo, urql)\n   - Authentication interceptors\n   - Error handling\n   - Loading states\n   - Retry logic\n\n5. **Performance Optimization**\n   - Code splitting\n   - Lazy loading\n   - Image optimization\n   - Bundle optimization\n   - Memoization (React.memo, useMemo)\n   - Virtual scrolling\n\n6. **Accessibility**\n   - ARIA labels\n   - Keyboard navigation\n   - Focus indicators\n   - Screen reader support\n   - Color contrast ratios\n   - Skip links\n\n## When to Use Me\n\nUse me when:\n- Building user interfaces\n- Creating single-page apps\n- Implementing responsive design\n- Optimizing frontend performance\n- Adding accessibility features\n- Building component libraries\n\n## My Technology Stack\n\n- **Frameworks**: React 18+, Next.js 14+, Vue 3, Svelte\n- **Styling**: TailwindCSS, Styled-Components, CSS Modules\n- **State Management**: Zustand, Redux Toolkit, Pinia\n- **Testing**: Playwright for E2E, Vitest for unit tests\n- **Build Tools**: Vite, Turbopack\n\n## Implementation Pattern\n\n### 1. Design System Setup\n- Review design specifications\n- Set up design tokens (colors, spacing, typography)\n- Create component library structure\n- Configure Tailwind or CSS-in-JS\n- Set up Storybook for component development\n\n### 2. Component Development\n\n**Atomic Design Approach:**\n\n**Atoms (Basic components):**\n- Button, Input, Label, Icon\n- Build in isolation\n- Document props in Storybook\n- Add TypeScript types\n\n**Molecules (Simple combinations):**\n- FormField (Label + Input + Error)\n- Card (Image + Title + Description)\n- SearchBar (Input + Icon + Button)\n- Test combinations\n\n**Organisms (Complex components):**\n- ProductCard (Image + Title + Price + AddToCart)\n- Header (Logo + Nav + SearchBar + Cart)\n- Footer (Links + Social + Newsletter)\n- Test with real data\n\n**Templates (Page layouts):**\n- HomePage Layout\n- ProductListPage Layout\n- ProductDetailPage Layout\n- CheckoutFlow Layout\n\n**Pages (Complete views):**\n- Connect to routing\n- Add data fetching\n- Handle loading/error states\n- Add SEO metadata\n\n### 3. State Management Setup\n\n**Global State:**\n- User authentication state\n- Shopping cart state\n- UI preferences (theme, language)\n\n**Server State:**\n- Use React Query or SWR\n- Configure caching strategy\n- Set up optimistic updates\n- Add refetch on focus\n\n**Local State:**\n- Form inputs\n- Modal visibility\n- Accordion expanded state\n\n### 4. Routing Implementation\n- Set up route structure\n- Add protected routes\n- Implement redirects\n- Add 404 page\n- Configure route-based code splitting\n- Add route transitions\n\n### 5. API Integration\n\n**REST API:**\n- Create API client with axios/fetch\n- Add interceptors for auth tokens\n- Centralize error handling\n- Add request/response logging\n- Implement retry logic\n\n**Realtime:**\n- WebSocket connection for live updates\n- Handle reconnection logic\n- Add heartbeat mechanism\n\n### 6. Performance Optimization\n- Code splitting at route level\n- Lazy load images with intersection observer\n- Implement virtual scrolling for long lists\n- Add service worker for caching\n- Optimize bundle size\n- Use React.memo for expensive components\n- Debounce search inputs\n- Throttle scroll handlers\n\n### 7. Accessibility\n- Add ARIA labels\n- Ensure keyboard navigation\n- Add focus indicators\n- Test with screen reader\n- Ensure color contrast ratios\n- Add skip links\n- Make forms accessible\n\n### 8. Self-Testing\n\n**Visual Testing:**\n- Start local dev server\n- Open in browser\n- Test all breakpoints\n- Verify visual design matches specs\n- Test interactions (hover, click, focus)\n\n**Automated Testing:**\n- Unit tests for utility functions\n- Integration tests for components\n- E2E tests for critical paths\n- Visual regression tests\n- Accessibility tests\n\n## Component Template\n\n```typescript\ninterface ProductCardProps {\n  product: {\n    id: string\n    name: string\n    price: number\n    imageUrl: string\n    rating: number\n    inStock: boolean\n  }\n  onAddToCart: (productId: string) => void\n}\n\nfunction ProductCard({ product, onAddToCart }: ProductCardProps) {\n  const [isAdding, setIsAdding] = useState(false)\n  const [showDetails, setShowDetails] = useState(false)\n\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    // Navigate to product detail\n  }\n\n  const handleAddToCart = async () => {\n    setIsAdding(true)\n    await onAddToCart(product.id)\n    setIsAdding(false)\n    // Show success toast\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <article className=\"product-card\">\n      {/* Component implementation */}\n    </article>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\nWhen working with me:\n1. **Start with design system** - Consistent components are reusable\n2. **Test responsively** - Mobile-first approach\n3. **Optimize early** - Performance is part of UX\n4. **Accessible by default** - Include everyone\n5. **Self-test frequently** - Catch issues early\n\n## What I Learn\n\nI store in memory:\n- Component patterns\n- State management strategies\n- Performance optimizations\n- Accessibility improvements\n- UI/UX best practices\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:55.011Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing to build responsive and interactive web applications with modern frameworks like React, Angular, or Vue","zh":"非常适合需要使用现代框架如 React, Angular 或 Vue 构建响应式和交互式 web 应用的 UI 专注 Agent","ja":"React, Angular、または Vue のようなモダンなフレームワークを使用してレスポンシブでインタラクティブな Web アプリケーションを構築する必要がある UI フォーカス エージェントに最適","ko":"React, Angular 또는 Vue와 같은 현대적인 프레임워크를 사용하여 반응형 및 상호작용형 웹 애플리케이션을 구축해야 하는 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan crear aplicaciones web responsivas e interactivas con frameworks modernos como React, Angular o Vue","fr":"Parfait pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur qui ont besoin de créer des applications web responsives et interactives avec des frameworks modernes comme React, Angular ou Vue","de":"Perfekt für benutzeroberflächenorientierte Agenten, die responsive und interaktive Webanwendungen mit modernen Frameworks wie React, Angular oder Vue erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que precisam criar aplicações web responsivas e interativas com frameworks modernos como React, Angular ou Vue","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимо создавать отзывчивые и интерактивные веб-приложения с использованием современных фреймворков, таких как React, Angular или Vue","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على الواجهة المستخدمة الذين يحتاجون إلى بناء تطبيقات ويب تفاعلية واستجابة مع إطارات حديثة مثل React و Angular أو Vue"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement atomic design patterns, manage global and server state with libraries like Zustand, Redux, and React Query, and style with CSS/Tailwind, adding animations for enhanced user experience","zh":"赋予代理实现原子设计模式的能力，使用像 Zustand, Redux 和 React Query这样的库管理全局和服务器状态，并使用 CSS/Tailwind 进行样式设计，添加动画以增强用户体验","ja":"Zustand、Redux、React Query などのライブラリを使用してグローバルおよびサーバー状態を管理し、CSS/Tailwind を使用してスタイルを設定し、動画を追加してユーザー エクスペリエンスを向上させるためにエージェントに原子デザイン パターンを実装する機能を提供","ko":"Zustand, Redux 및 React Query와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 전역 및 서버 상태를 관리하고, CSS/Tailwind를 사용하여 스타일을 지정하며, 애니메이션을 추가하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키기 위해 에이전트가 원자적 디자인 패턴을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar patrones de diseño atómicos, gestionar el estado global y del servidor con bibliotecas como Zustand, Redux y React Query, y dar estilo con CSS/Tailwind, agregando animaciones para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des modèles de conception atomiques, de gérer l''état global et du serveur avec des bibliothèques comme Zustand, Redux et React Query, et de styliser avec CSS/Tailwind, en ajoutant des animations pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, atomare Designmuster zu implementieren, den globalen und Server-Zustand mit Bibliotheken wie Zustand, Redux und React Query zu verwalten und mit CSS/Tailwind zu stylen, wobei Animationen für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung hinzugefügt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar padrões de design atômicos, gerenciar estado global e do servidor com bibliotecas como Zustand, Redux e React Query, e estilizar com CSS/Tailwind, adicionando animações para uma experiência do usuário aprimorada","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать атомные шаблоны проектирования, управлять глобальным и серверным состоянием с помощью библиотек, таких как Zustand, Redux и React Query, и оформлять с помощью CSS/Tailwind, добавляя анимации для улучшения пользовательского опыта","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تنفيذ أنماط التصميم الذرية وإدارة الحالة العالمية وخادم مع مكتبات مثل Zustand و Redux و React Query وتحسينها مع CSS/Tailwind ، وإضافة الرسوم المتحركة لتجربة مستخدم محسنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building reusable UI components with responsive design","Implementing state management solutions using Redux or Pinia","Creating interactive page layouts with CSS/Tailwind styling and animations"],"zh":["使用响应式设计构建可重用 UI 组件","使用 Redux 或 Pinia 实现状态管理解决方案","使用 CSS/Tailwind 样式和动画创建交互式页面布局"],"ja":["レスポンシブ デザインを使用して再利用可能な UI コンポーネントを構築する","Redux または Pinia を使用してステート管理ソリューションを実装する","CSS/Tailwind スタイルとアニメーションを使用してインタラクティブなページ レイアウトを作成する"],"ko":["반응형 디자인을 사용하여 재사용 가능한 UI 컴포넌트를 구축하는 것","Redux 또는 Pinia를 사용하여 상태 관리 솔루션을 구현하는 것","CSS/Tailwind 스타일 및 애니메이션을 사용하여 상호작용형 페이지 레이아웃을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario reutilizables con diseño responsivo","Implementar soluciones de gestión de estado utilizando Redux o Pinia","Crear diseños de página interactivos con estilos CSS/Tailwind y animaciones"],"fr":["Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur réutilisables avec une conception responsive","Mettre en œuvre des solutions de gestion d''état en utilisant Redux ou Pinia","Créer des dispositions de page interactives avec des styles CSS/Tailwind et des animations"],"de":["Wiederverwendbare Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit responsivem Design erstellen","Statusverwaltungslösungen mit Redux oder Pinia implementieren","Interaktive Seitenlayouts mit CSS/Tailwind-Styling und Animationen erstellen"],"pt":["Construir componentes de UI reutilizáveis com design responsivo","Implementar soluções de gerenciamento de estado usando Redux ou Pinia","Criar layouts de página interativos com estilização CSS/Tailwind e animações"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов UI с адаптивным дизайном","Реализация решений по управлению состоянием с помощью Redux или Pinia","Создание интерактивных макетов страниц с помощью стилей CSS/Tailwind и анимаций"],"ar":["بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع تصميم مستجيب","تنفيذ حلول لإدارة الحالة باستخدام Redux أو Pinia","إنشاء تخطيطات صفحة تفاعلية مع تنسيق CSS/Tailwind والرسوم المتحركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of modern frontend frameworks","Limited to web application development","Dependent on CSS/Tailwind for styling"],"zh":["需要现代前端框架的知识","仅限于 Web 应用程序开发","依赖 CSS/Tailwind 进行样式设计"],"ja":["モダンなフロントエンド フレームワークの知識が必要","Web アプリケーション開発に限定される","CSS/Tailwind にスタイル設定に依存する"],"ko":["현대적인 프론트엔드 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","웹 애플리케이션 개발에만 국한됨","CSS/Tailwind에 대한 스타일 지정에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de frameworks de frontend modernos","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones web","Dependiente de CSS/Tailwind para el estilo"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en frameworks de frontend modernes","Limité au développement d''applications web","Dépendant de CSS/Tailwind pour le style"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse moderner Frontend-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Webanwendungen","Abhängig von CSS/Tailwind für das Styling"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de frameworks de frontend modernos","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações web","Dependente de CSS/Tailwind para estilização"],"ru":["Требует знания современных фреймворков frontend","Ограничен разработкой веб-приложений","Зависит от CSS/Tailwind для стилизации"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالإطارات الأمامية الحديثة","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات الويب","يعتمد على CSS/Tailwind للتنسيق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d6dd74434ffbe464c58f5e7c56f8564ab5e37d23d28cc7676878632327dc5672","qualityScore":57}');
