VM アーキテクチャを使用してアプリケーション ロジックを分離","MSIX を使用してアプリケーションをパッケージ化と配布","Windows 機能とサービスを統合"],"ko":["WinUI 3를 사용하여 현대적인 Windows 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축","WPF를 사용하여 XAML 레이아웃과 커스텀 컨트롤을 구현","MVVM 아키텍처를 사용하여 애플리케이션 로직을 분리","MSIX를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 패키징하고 배포","Windows 기능과 서비스를 통합"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio de Windows con WinUI 3","Implementación de arquitectura MVVM para aplicaciones de Windows","Creación de diseños de interfaz de usuario XAML y controles personalizados","Empaquetado de aplicaciones con MSIX","Integración con características de Windows"],"fr":["Développement d''applications de bureau Windows avec WinUI 3","Mise en œuvre de l''architecture MVVM pour les applications Windows","Création de conceptions d''interface utilisateur XAML et de contrôles personnalisés","Packaging d''applications avec MSIX","Intégration avec les fonctionnalités de Windows"],"de":["Entwicklung von Windows-Desktop-Anwendungen mit WinUI 3","Implementierung der MVVM-Architektur für Windows-Anwendungen","Erstellung von XAML-Benutzeroberflächen und benutzerdefinierten Steuerelementen","Verpackung von Anwendungen mit MSIX","Integration mit Windows-Funktionen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de UI baseado em XAML","Arquitetura MVVM para aplicativos do Windows","Integração nativa do Windows","Embalar aplicativos com MSIX","Suporte a WinUI 3 e WPF"],"ru":["Разработка интерфейса пользователя на основе XAML","Архитектура MVVM для приложений Windows","Родная интеграция с Windows","Упаковка приложений с MSIX","Поддержка WinUI 3 и WPF"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم القائمة على XAML","بنية MVVM لتطبيقات ويندوز","الاندماج الأصلي مع نظام ويندوز","تغليف التطبيقات مع MSIX","دعم WinUI 3 و WPF"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use windows-app-developer","windows-app-developer setup guide","windows-app-developer vs WPF","windows-app-developer install","what is windows-app-developer","windows-app-developer alternative","windows-app-developer with MSIX","windows-app-developer and WinUI 3","windows-app-developer MVVM architecture"],"zh":["Windows 应用开发","WinUI 3","WPF","Windows App SDK","XAML 布局","MVVM 架构","MSIX 包装","Windows 功能集成"],"ja":["Windows アプリ開発","WinUI 3","WPF","Windows App SDK","XAML レイアウト","MVVM アーキテクチャ","MSIX パッケージング","Windows 機能統合"],"ko":["Windows 애플리케이션 개발","WinUI 3","WPF","Windows App SDK","XAML 레이아웃","MVVM 아키텍처","MSIX 패키징","Windows 기능 통합"],"es":["desarrollador de aplicaciones de Windows","WinUI 3","WPF","Windows App SDK","XAML","MVVM","MSIX","integración con Windows","herramientas de desarrollo de Windows"],"fr":["développeur d''applications Windows","WinUI 3","WPF","Windows App SDK","XAML","MVVM","MSIX","intégration avec Windows","outils de développement Windows"],"de":["Windows-App-Entwickler","WinUI 3","WPF","Windows App SDK","XAML","MVVM","MSIX","Integration mit Windows","Windows-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["desenvolvedor de aplicativos do windows","winui 3","wpf","windows app sdk","xaml","mvvm","msix","integração nativa do windows"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для разработки приложений Windows","winui 3","wpf","windows app sdk","xaml","mvvm","msix","родная интеграция с Windows"],"ar":["مطور تطبيقات ويندوز","winui 3","wpf","windows app sdk","xaml","mvvm","msix","الاندماج الأصلي مع نظام ويندوز"]}},"owner":"kyle93afc","repo":"drawingregisterMJ","repoPath":"kyle93afc/drawingregisterMJ","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.587Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"windows-app-developer","description":"Expert in building modern Windows applications using WinUI 3, WPF, and the Windows App SDK. Specializes in MSIX packaging, XAML styling, and MVVM architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Windows App Developer\n\n## Purpose\nProvides expertise in building modern Windows desktop applications using WinUI 3, WPF, and Windows App SDK. Specializes in XAML-based UI development, MVVM architecture, native Windows integration, and modern packaging with MSIX.\n\n## When to Use\n- Building Windows desktop applications with WinUI 3 or WPF\n- Implementing MVVM architecture for Windows apps\n- Creating XAML layouts and custom controls\n- Packaging applications with MSIX\n- Integrating with Windows fea","body":"# Windows App Developer\n\n## Purpose\nProvides expertise in building modern Windows desktop applications using WinUI 3, WPF, and Windows App SDK. Specializes in XAML-based UI development, MVVM architecture, native Windows integration, and modern packaging with MSIX.\n\n## When to Use\n- Building Windows desktop applications with WinUI 3 or WPF\n- Implementing MVVM architecture for Windows apps\n- Creating XAML layouts and custom controls\n- Packaging applications with MSIX\n- Integrating with Windows features (notifications, taskbar, system tray)\n- Migrating WPF applications to WinUI 3\n- Implementing Windows-specific features (jump lists, live tiles)\n- Building Microsoft Store-ready applications\n\n## Quick Start\n**Invoke this skill when:**\n- Building Windows desktop applications with WinUI 3 or WPF\n- Implementing MVVM architecture for Windows apps\n- Creating XAML layouts and custom controls\n- Packaging applications with MSIX\n- Integrating with Windows features (notifications, taskbar)\n\n**Do NOT invoke when:**\n- Building cross-platform apps → use mobile-developer or electron-pro\n- Console applications → use appropriate language skill\n- PowerShell GUI → use powershell-ui-architect\n- Web applications → use appropriate web skill\n\n## Decision Framework\n```\nWindows App Task?\n├── New Modern App → WinUI 3 with Windows App SDK\n├── Existing WPF App → Maintain or migrate to WinUI 3\n├── Cross-Platform Priority → Consider .NET MAUI\n├── Enterprise Internal → WPF with proven patterns\n├── Store Distribution → MSIX packaging required\n└── System Integration → P/Invoke or Windows SDK APIs\n```\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. WinUI 3 Application Setup\n1. Create project using Windows App SDK template\n2. Configure Package.appxmanifest for capabilities\n3. Set up MVVM infrastructure (CommunityToolkit.Mvvm)\n4. Implement navigation and shell structure\n5. Create reusable control library\n6. Configure MSIX packaging\n7. Set up CI/CD for Store or sideload distribution\n\n### 2. MVVM Implementation\n1. Define ViewModels with observable properties\n2. Implement commands for user actions\n3. Create services for data and business logic\n4. Set up dependency injection container\n5. Bind Views to ViewModels in XAML\n6. Implement navigation service\n7. Add design-time data for XAML preview\n\n### 3. MSIX Packaging\n1. Configure Package.appxmanifest\n2. Define application identity and capabilities\n3. Set up visual assets (icons, splash)\n4. Configure installation behavior\n5. Sign package with certificate\n6. Test installation and updates\n7. Submit to Microsoft Store or deploy internally\n\n## Best Practices\n- Use WinUI 3 for new development, WPF for legacy maintenance\n- Implement MVVM strictly for testability and separation\n- Use x:Bind for compile-time binding validation\n- Leverage Community Toolkit for common patterns\n- Package with MSIX for modern installation experience\n- Follow Fluent Design System for consistent UX\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n- **Code-behind logic** → Move to ViewModels\n- **Synchronous UI operations** → Use async/await for I/O\n- **Direct service calls from Views** → Go through ViewModels\n- **Ignoring DPI awareness** → Test at multiple scale factors\n- **Missing capabilities** → Declare required capabilities in manifest\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:58.109Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for UI-focused Agents needing to create native Windows integrations with WinUI 3, WPF, and Windows App SDK expertise.","zh":"适用于需要创建本地Windows集成的UI焦点代理，需要WinUI 3，WPF和Windows App SDK的专业知识。","ja":"WinUI 3、WPF、Windows App SDKの専門知識を必要とする、ネイティブWindows統合を作成する必要があるUI中心のエージェントに最適です。","ko":"네이티브 Windows 통합을 만들 필요가 있는 UI 중심 에이전트에게 적합하며, WinUI 3, WPF 및 Windows App SDK 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan crear integraciones nativas de Windows con WinUI 3, WPF y experiencia en Windows App SDK.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant la création d''intégrations Windows natives avec WinUI 3, WPF et expertise en Windows App SDK.","de":"Ideal für benutzeroberflächenorientierte Agenten, die native Windows-Integrationen mit WinUI 3, WPF und Windows App SDK-Expertise erstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes com foco em UI que precisam criar integrações nativas do Windows com expertise em WinUI 3, WPF e Windows App SDK.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимо создавать родные интеграции с Windows с помощью WinUI 3, WPF и экспертизы Windows App SDK.","ar":"مثالي لعميل يركز على واجهة المستخدم و يحتاج إلى إنشاء تكاملات أصلية مع نظام التشغيل Windows مع خبرة في WinUI 3 و WPF و Windows App SDK."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build modern Windows desktop applications using XAML-based UI development, MVVM architecture, and modern packaging with MSIX, leveraging native Windows integration and WinUI 3 capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理创建现代Windows桌面应用的能力，使用基于XAML的UI开发、MVVM架构和现代的MSIX打包，利用本地Windows集成和WinUI 3的功能。","ja":"エージェントに、XAMLベースのUI開発、MVVMアーキテクチャ、MSIXを使用したモダンなパッケージングを使用して、ネイティブWindows統合とWinUI 3の機能を利用した、モダンなWindowsデスクトップアプリケーションを作成する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 XAML 기반 UI 개발, MVVM 아키텍처 및 MSIX를 사용한 모던한 패키징을 사용하여 네이티브 Windows 통합 및 WinUI 3의 기능을 활용한 최신 Windows 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones de escritorio de Windows modernas utilizando el desarrollo de interfaz de usuario basado en XAML, arquitectura MVVM y empaquetado moderno con MSIX, aprovechando la integración nativa de Windows y las capacidades de WinUI 3.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications de bureau Windows modernes en utilisant le développement d''interface utilisateur basé sur XAML, l''architecture MVVM et l''emballage moderne avec MSIX, en exploitant l''intégration native de Windows et les capacités de WinUI 3.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, moderne Windows-Desktop-Anwendungen zu erstellen, indem sie die XAML-basierte Benutzeroberflächenentwicklung, die MVVM-Architektur und das moderne Verpacken mit MSIX nutzen und dabei die native Windows-Integration und die WinUI 3-Funktionen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem aplicações de desktop modernas do Windows utilizando desenvolvimento de UI baseado em XAML, arquitetura MVVM e embalagem moderna com MSIX, aproveitando as capacidades de integração nativa do Windows e WinUI 3.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать современные приложения для рабочего стола Windows, используя разработку UI на основе XAML, архитектуру MVVM и современную упаковку с помощью MSIX, используя возможности родной интеграции с Windows и WinUI 3.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنشاء تطبيقات سطح المكتب الحديثة لنظام التشغيل Windows باستخدام تطوير واجهة المستخدم القائمة على XAML و هيكل MVVM و التغليف الحديث مع MSIX و الاستفادة من возможات التكامل الأصلي لنظام التشغيل Windows و WinUI 3."},"useCases":{"en":["Building Windows desktop applications with WinUI 3 or WPF","Implementing MVVM architecture for Windows apps","Creating XAML layouts and custom controls","Packaging applications with MSIX"],"zh":["使用WinUI 3或WPF构建Windows桌面应用程序","为Windows应用程序实现MVVM架构","创建XAML布局和自定义控件","使用MSIX打包应用程序"],"ja":["WinUI 3またはWPFを使用したWindowsデスクトップアプリケーションの構築","WindowsアプリケーションのMVVMアーキテクチャの実装","XAMLレイアウトとカスタムコントロールの作成","MSIXを使用したアプリケーションのパッケージング"],"ko":["WinUI 3 또는 WPF를 사용한 Windows 데스크톱 애플리케이션 구축","Windows 애플리케이션에 대한 MVVM 아키텍처 구현","XAML 레이아웃 및 사용자 정의 컨트롤 생성","MSIX를 사용한 애플리케이션 패키징"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones de escritorio de Windows con WinUI 3 o WPF","Implementación de la arquitectura MVVM para aplicaciones de Windows","Creación de diseños de XAML y controles personalizados","Empaquetado de aplicaciones con MSIX"],"fr":["Création d''applications de bureau Windows avec WinUI 3 ou WPF","Mise en œuvre de l''architecture MVVM pour les applications Windows","Création de mises en page XAML et de contrôles personnalisés","Emballage d''applications avec MSIX"],"de":["Erstellung von Windows-Desktop-Anwendungen mit WinUI 3 oder WPF","Implementierung der MVVM-Architektur für Windows-Anwendungen","Erstellung von XAML-Layouts und benutzerdefinierten Steuerelementen","Verpacken von Anwendungen mit MSIX"],"pt":["Construir aplicações de desktop do Windows com WinUI 3 ou WPF","Implementar arquitetura MVVM para aplicativos do Windows","Criar layouts XAML e controles personalizados","Empacotar aplicações com MSIX"],"ru":["Создание приложений для рабочего стола Windows с помощью WinUI 3 или WPF","Реализация архитектуры MVVM для приложений Windows","Создание макетов XAML и пользовательских элементов управления","Упаковка приложений с помощью MSIX"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات سطح المكتب لنظام التشغيل Windows باستخدام WinUI 3 أو WPF","تنفيذ هيكل MVVM لتطبيقات نظام التشغيل Windows","إنشاء تخطيطات XAML و عناصر تحكم مخصصة","تغليف التطبيقات مع MSIX"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Windows development environment","Limited to Windows desktop application development","Dependent on MSIX for packaging"],"zh":["需要Windows开发环境","仅限Windows桌面应用程序开发","依赖MSIX进行打包"],"ja":["Windows開発環境が必要","Windowsデスクトップアプリケーションの開発のみ","パッケージングにMSIXに依存"],"ko":["Windows 개발 환경이 필요합니다.","Windows 데스크톱 애플리케이션 개발만 가능합니다.","패키징에 MSIX에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de desarrollo de Windows","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones de escritorio de Windows","Dependiente de MSIX para el empaquetado"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement Windows","Limité au développement d''applications de bureau Windows","Dépendant de MSIX pour l''emballage"],"de":["Benötigt eine Windows-Entwicklungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Windows-Desktop-Anwendungen","Abhängig von MSIX für das Verpacken"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de desenvolvimento do Windows","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações de desktop do Windows","Dependente de MSIX para embalagem"],"ru":["Требуется среда разработки Windows","Ограничен разработкой приложений для рабочего стола Windows","Зависит от MSIX для упаковки"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير لنظام التشغيل Windows","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات سطح المكتب لنظام التشغيل Windows","يعتمد على MSIX للتغليف"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"104e22d8ed6802a2ec34a50dfeb305b18ee7d705c3ad6a1d6d8035377fca17d1","qualityScore":57}');
