INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kyle93afc/drawingregisterMJ/windows-app-developer', 'windows-app-developer', 'kyle93afc', 'drawingregisterMJ', 'community', 'windows-app-developer kyle93afc drawingregisterMJ community The Windows-App-Developer skill provides expertise in building modern Windows desktop applications using WinUI 3, WPF, and Windows App SDK, benefiting developers who need to create native Windows integrations and modern packaging with MSIX. Windows 应用开发涉及使用 WinUI 3、WPF 和 Windows App SDK 构建现代 Windows 桌面应用程序，包括 XAML 布局和 MVVM 架构 Windows アプリ開発は、WinUI 3、WPF、Windows App SDK を使用してモダンな Windows デスクトップ アプリケーションを構築することを含み、XAML レイアウトと MVVM アーキテクチャを使用 Windows 애플리케이션 개발은 WinUI 3, WPF 및 Windows App SDK를 사용하여 현대적인 Windows 데스크톱 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것을 포함하며, XAML 레이아웃 및 MVVM 아키텍처를 사용 El desarrollador de aplicaciones de Windows proporciona experiencia en la creación de aplicaciones de escritorio de Windows modernas con WinUI 3 y WPF. Le développeur d''applications Windows offre une expertise dans la création d''applications de bureau Windows modernes avec WinUI 3 et WPF. Der Windows-App-Entwickler bietet Erfahrung bei der Erstellung moderner Windows-Desktop-Anwendungen mit WinUI 3 und WPF. O Desenvolvedor de Aplicativos do Windows fornece especialização em desenvolvimento de UI baseado em XAML, arquitetura MVVM e integração nativa do Windows. ИИ Агент для разработки приложений Windows обеспечивает специализацию в разработке интерфейса пользователя на основе XAML, архитектуре MVVM и родной интеграции с Windows. مطور تطبيقات ويندوز يوفر تخصصا في تطوير واجهة المستخدم القائمة على XAML و بنية MVVM والاندماج الأصلي مع نظام ويندوز. how to use windows-app-developer windows-app-developer setup guide windows-app-developer vs WPF windows-app-developer install what is windows-app-developer windows-app-developer alternative windows-app-developer with MSIX windows-app-developer and WinUI 3 windows-app-developer MVVM architecture Windows 应用开发 WinUI 3 WPF Windows App SDK XAML 布局 MVVM 架构 MSIX 包装 Windows 功能集成 Builds Windows desktop applications using WinUI 3 and WPF Implements MVVM architecture for Windows apps Creates XAML layouts and custom controls Packages applications with MSIX for modern deployment Integrates with native Windows features for seamless user experience Windows-App-Developer is a skill that specializes in XAML-based UI development, MVVM architecture, and native Windows integration for building modern Windows desktop applications.');
