ión y edición de Google Docs de forma programática","Gestión de mensajes de Gmail y envío de correos electrónicos","Trabajo con archivos y carpetas de Google Drive","Automatización de eventos en Google Calendar"],"fr":["Automatisation des opérations dans Google Sheets","Création et édition de Google Docs de manière programmatique","Gestion des messages Gmail et envoi de courriels","Travail avec les fichiers et dossiers de Google Drive","Automatisation des événements dans Google Calendar"],"de":["Automatisierung von Operationen in Google Sheets","Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Google Docs in programmatischer Form","Verwaltung von Gmail-Nachrichten und Versand von E-Mails","Arbeit mit Google Drive-Dateien und -Ordnern","Automatisierung von Ereignissen in Google Calendar"],"pt":["Automação de operações do Google Sheets","Criação e edição programática de Google Docs","Gerenciamento de mensagens do Gmail e envio de e-mails","Trabalho com arquivos e pastas do Google Drive","Automação do Google Calendar"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций Google Sheets","Программное создание и редактирование Google Docs","Управление сообщениями Gmail и отправка электронных писем","Работа с файлами и папками Google Drive","Автоматизация Google Calendar"],"ar":["تلقيم عمليات جوجل شييتس","إنشاء وتحرير جوجل دوكس بالبرمجة","إدارة رسائل جوجل ميل وإرسال البريد الإلكتروني","العمل مع الملفات والمجلدات جوجل درايف","تلقيم جوجل كالندر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use google-apps-script","google-apps-script tutorial","google-apps-script alternative","google-apps-script vs zapier","google-apps-script install","google-apps-script setup guide","automating google sheets with google-apps-script","google-apps-script for gmail automation","google-apps-script documentation"],"zh":["Google Apps Script","Google Workspace 自动化","JavaScript 平台","Google Sheets 自动化","Google Docs 编程","Gmail 消息管理","Google Drive 文件操作"],"ja":["Google Apps Script","Google Workspace 自動化","JavaScript プラットフォーム","Google Sheets 自動化","Google Docs プログラミング","Gmail メッセージ管理","Google Drive ファイル操作"],"ko":["Google Apps Script","Google Workspace 자동화","JavaScript 플랫폼","Google Sheets 자동화","Google Docs 프로그래밍","Gmail 메시지 관리","Google Drive 파일 조작"],"es":["google apps script","automatización de google sheets","google docs api","gmail api","google drive api","google calendar api","javascript en la nube","automatización de tareas","integración con google workspace"],"fr":["google apps script","automatisation de google sheets","google docs api","gmail api","google drive api","google calendar api","javascript basé sur le cloud","automatisation de tâches","intégration avec google workspace"],"de":["google apps script","automatisierung von google sheets","google docs api","gmail api","google drive api","google calendar api","javascript in der cloud","automatisierung von aufgaben","integration mit google workspace"],"pt":["google apps script","automação de serviços do google workspace","javascript para google sheets","criação de google docs programática","gerenciamento de gmail","trabalho com google drive","automação do google calendar","desenvolvimento de aplicativos para google workspace"],"ru":["google apps script","автоматизация сервисов google workspace","javascript для google sheets","программное создание google docs","управление gmail","работа с google drive","автоматизация google calendar","разработка приложений для google workspace"],"ar":["سكريبت تطبيقات جوجل","تلقيم خدمات جوجل ووركسبيس","جافاسكريبت لجوجل شييتس","إنشاء جوجل دوكس بالبرمجة","إدارة جوجل ميل","العمل مع جوجل درايف","تلقيم جوجل كالندر","تطوير تطبيقات لجوجل ووركسبيس"]}},"owner":"fakebizprez","repo":"cleanUpUntitled","repoPath":"fakebizprez/cleanUpUntitled","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.594Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-apps-script","description":"Comprehensive guide for Google Apps Script development covering all built-in services (SpreadsheetApp, DocumentApp, GmailApp, DriveApp, CalendarApp, FormApp, SlidesApp), triggers, authorization, error handling, and performance optimization. Use when automating Google Sheets operations, creating Google Docs, managing Gmail/email, working with Google Drive files, automating Calendar events, implementing triggers (time-based, event-based), building custom functions, creating add-ons, handling OAuth scopes, optimizing Apps Script performance, working with UrlFetchApp for API calls, using PropertiesService for persistent storage, or implementing CacheService for temporary data. Covers batch operations, error recovery, and JavaScript ES6+ runtime.","bodyPreview":"# Google Apps Script\n\n## Overview\n\nCloud-based JavaScript platform for automating Google Workspace services. Server-side V8 runtime with automatic OAuth integration across Sheets, Docs, Gmail, Drive, Calendar, and more.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n\n- Automating Google Sheets operations (reading, writing, formatting)\n- Creating or editing Google Docs programmatically\n- Managing Gmail messages and sending emails\n- Working with Google Drive files and folders\n- Automating Goo","body":"# Google Apps Script\n\n## Overview\n\nCloud-based JavaScript platform for automating Google Workspace services. Server-side V8 runtime with automatic OAuth integration across Sheets, Docs, Gmail, Drive, Calendar, and more.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n\n- Automating Google Sheets operations (reading, writing, formatting)\n- Creating or editing Google Docs programmatically\n- Managing Gmail messages and sending emails\n- Working with Google Drive files and folders\n- Automating Google Calendar events\n- Implementing triggers (time-based or event-based)\n- Building custom functions for Sheets\n- Creating Google Workspace add-ons\n- Handling OAuth scopes and authorisation\n- Making HTTP requests to external APIs with UrlFetchApp\n- Using persistent storage with PropertiesService\n- Implementing caching strategies with CacheService\n- Optimising performance with batch operations\n- Debugging Apps Script code or authorisation issues\n\n## Core Services\n\n1. **SpreadsheetApp** - Google Sheets automation (read, write, format, data validation)\n2. **DocumentApp** - Google Docs creation and editing\n3. **GmailApp & MailApp** - Email operations (send, search, manage labels)\n4. **DriveApp** - File and folder management, sharing, permissions\n5. **CalendarApp** - Calendar events, recurring appointments, reminders\n6. **Triggers & ScriptApp** - Time-based and event-driven automation\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```javascript\nfunction generateWeeklyReport() {\n  const ss = SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSpreadsheet();\n  const sheet = ss.getSheetByName(''Data'');\n  const data = sheet.getRange(''A2:D'').getValues();\n\n  const report = data.filter(row => row[0]);\n  const summarySheet = ss.getSheetByName(''Summary'') || ss.insertSheet(''Summary'');\n  summarySheet.clear();\n  summarySheet.appendRow([''Name'', ''Value'', ''Status'']);\n  report.forEach(row => summarySheet.appendRow([row[0], row[1], row[2]]));\n\n  MailApp.sendEmail({\n    to: Session.getEffectiveUser().getEmail(),\n    subject: ''Weekly Report Generated'',\n    body: `Report generated with ${report.length} records.`\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Batch operations** - read/write ranges in bulk, never cell-by-cell in loops\n- **Cache data** - use CacheService (25 min TTL) for frequently accessed data\n- **Error handling** - wrap operations in try/catch, log errors to a sheet for audit trails\n- **Respect limits** - 6-minute execution timeout; split large jobs across triggers\n- **Minimise scopes** - request only necessary OAuth permissions in `appscript.json`\n- **Persistent storage** - use PropertiesService for configuration and state\n- **Validate inputs** - always check objects exist before accessing properties\n\nSee [references/best-practices.md](references/best-practices.md) for detailed examples of each practice.\n\n## Validation & Testing\n\nUse the validation scripts in `scripts/` for pre-deployment checks:\n\n- **scripts/validators.py** - Validate spreadsheet operations, range notations, and data structures\n\nDebug with `Logger.log()` and view output via View > Logs (Cmd/Ctrl + Enter). Use breakpoints in the Apps Script editor for step-through debugging.\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **google-ads-scripts** - Export Google Ads data to Sheets for reporting\n- **gtm-datalayer** - Coordinate with GTM for tracking events triggered by Apps Script\n- **ga4-bigquery** - Query BigQuery from Apps Script and write results to Sheets\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Execution timeout | Split work into smaller batches or use multiple triggers |\n| Authorisation error | Check OAuth scopes in manifest file |\n| Quota exceeded | Reduce API call frequency, use caching |\n| Null reference error | Validate objects exist before accessing properties |\n\n## References\n\nDetailed content is available in reference files (loaded on demand):\n\n- [references/apps-script-api-reference.md](references/apps-script-api-reference.md) - Complete API reference for all built-in services, triggers, authorisation, and performance optimisation\n- [references/examples.md](references/examples.md) - Production-ready code examples (spreadsheet reports, Gmail auto-responder, document generation, trigger setup)\n- [references/best-practices.md](references/best-practices.md) - Detailed best practices with code blocks for batch operations, caching, error handling, scopes, and persistence\n- [references/patterns.md](references/patterns.md) - Common reusable patterns (data validation, retry logic, form response processing)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:12:04.861Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Automation Agents needing integrated Google Workspace service automation via JavaScript","zh":"非常适合需要通过JavaScript集成Google Workspace服务自动化的云自动化代理","ja":"JavaScriptを使用してGoogle Workspaceサービスを統合して自動化する必要があるクラウド自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"JavaScript를 사용하여 Google Workspace 서비스를 통합하여 자동화해야 하는 클라우드 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización en la nube que necesitan automatización de servicios de Google Workspace integrada a través de JavaScript","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation du cloud nécessitant une automatisation des services Google Workspace intégrée via JavaScript","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine integrierte Google-Workspace-Serviceautomatisierung über JavaScript benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação em Nuvem que necessitam de automação de serviço do Google Workspace integrada via JavaScript","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации в облаке, которым требуется интегрированная автоматизация сервисов Google Workspace через JavaScript","ar":"مثالي لعميل تلقائي سحابي يحتاج إلى خدمة تلقائية متكاملة لمكتب جوجل عبر لغة جافاسكريبت"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Google Sheets operations, create and edit Google Docs programmatically, and manage Gmail messages using server-side V8 runtime with automatic OAuth integration across Google Workspace services, including Sheets, Docs, Gmail, Drive, and Calendar","zh":"赋予代理自动化Google Sheets操作、编程方式创建和编辑Google Docs，并使用服务器端V8运行时自动OAuth集成来管理Gmail消息，涵盖Google Workspace服务，包括Sheets、Docs、Gmail、Drive和Calendar","ja":"エージェントにGoogle Sheets操作の自動化、Google Docsのプログラムによる作成と編集、サーバーサイドV8ランタイムを使用したOAuthの自動統合によるGmailメッセージの管理を可能にし、Sheets、Docs、Gmail、Drive、Calendarを含むGoogle Workspaceサービスをカバー","ko":"에이전트가 Google Sheets 연산을 자동화하고, Google Docs를 프로그래밍 방식으로 생성하고 편집하며, 서버 측 V8 런타임을 사용하여 OAuth 통합을 자동으로 수행하여 Gmail 메시지를 관리할 수 있도록 하여, Sheets, Docs, Gmail, Drive, Calendar를 포함한 Google Workspace 서비스를 다룸","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar operaciones de Google Sheets, crear y editar Google Docs de forma programática y gestionar mensajes de Gmail utilizando el tiempo de ejecución V8 del lado del servidor con integración automática de OAuth en todos los servicios de Google Workspace, incluidos Sheets, Docs, Gmail, Drive y Calendar","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations Google Sheets, de créer et de modifier des Google Docs de manière programmatique, et de gérer les messages Gmail en utilisant le runtime V8 côté serveur avec une intégration OAuth automatique sur tous les services Google Workspace, notamment Sheets, Docs, Gmail, Drive et Calendar","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Google Sheets-Operationen zu automatisieren, Google Docs programmgesteuert zu erstellen und zu bearbeiten und Gmail-Nachrichten mithilfe der serverseitigen V8-Laufzeit mit automatischer OAuth-Integration über alle Google-Workspace-Dienste hinweg zu verwalten, einschließlich Sheets, Docs, Gmail, Drive und Calendar","pt":"Habilita agentes a automatizar operações do Google Planilhas, criar e editar documentos do Google Docs programaticamente e gerenciar mensagens do Gmail usando o tempo de execução V8 do servidor com integração OAuth automática em todos os serviços do Google Workspace, incluindo Planilhas, Docs, Gmail, Drive e Calendário","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать операции Google Таблиц, создавать и редактировать документы Google Docs программно, а также управлять сообщениями Gmail с использованием серверного времени выполнения V8 и автоматической интеграции OAuth во всех сервисах Google Workspace, включая Таблицы, Docs, Gmail, Диск и Календарь","ar":"يمكن للعميل التلقائي تمكين الوكلاء من تلقين عمليات جوجل الشيتات، وإنشاء وتحرير مستندات جوجل دوكس برمجيًا، وإدارة رسائل جيميل باستخدام وقت تشغيل خادم V8 مع دمج OAuth آلي عبر جميع خدمات جوجل وورкспيس، بما في ذلك الشيتات، دوكس، جيميل، درايف، وجدول"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Google Sheets data processing and formatting","Generating and editing Google Docs programmatically","Managing and sending Gmail messages with attachments from Google Drive"],"zh":["自动化Google Sheets数据处理和格式化","以编程方式生成和编辑Google Docs","使用Google Drive附件管理和发送Gmail消息"],"ja":["Google Sheetsデータの処理とフォーマットの自動化","Google Docsのプログラムによる生成と編集","Google Driveの添付ファイルを使用したGmailメッセージの管理と送信"],"ko":["Google Sheets 데이터 처리 및 서식 자동화","Google Docs를 프로그래밍 방식으로 생성하고 편집","Google Drive附件를 사용하여 Gmail 메시지 관리 및 전송"],"es":["Automatización del procesamiento y formato de datos de Google Sheets","Generación y edición programática de Google Docs","Gestión y envío de mensajes de Gmail con adjuntos desde Google Drive"],"fr":["Automatisation du traitement et du formatage des données Google Sheets","Génération et édition programmatique de Google Docs","Gestion et envoi de messages Gmail avec des pièces jointes à partir de Google Drive"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verarbeitung und Formatierung von Google Sheets-Daten","Programmgesteuerte Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Google Docs","Verwaltung und Versand von Gmail-Nachrichten mit Anlagen aus Google Drive"],"pt":["Automatizar processamento e formatação de dados do Google Planilhas","Gerar e editar documentos do Google Docs programaticamente","Gerenciar e enviar mensagens do Gmail com anexos do Google Drive"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обработку и форматирование данных Google Таблиц","Генерировать и редактировать документы Google Docs программно","Управлять и отправлять сообщения Gmail с вложениями из Google Диск"],"ar":["تلقين معالجة وتحويل بيانات جوجل الشيتات","إنشاء وتحرير مستندات جوجل دوكس برمجيًا","إدارة وإرسال رسائل جيميل مع مرفقات من جوجل درايف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Google account authentication for OAuth integration","Limited to Google Workspace services only"],"zh":["需要Google帐户身份验证以进行OAuth集成","仅限Google Workspace服务"],"ja":["OAuth統合のためにGoogleアカウントの認証が必要","Google Workspaceサービスのみに限定"],"ko":["OAuth 통합을 위해 Google 계정 인증이 필요","Google Workspace 서비스 만 해당"],"es":["Requiere autenticación de cuenta de Google para la integración de OAuth","Limitado solo a los servicios de Google Workspace"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification de compte Google pour l''intégration OAuth","Limité uniquement aux services Google Workspace"],"de":["Benötigt Google-Kontenauthentifizierung für die OAuth-Integration","Begrenzt auf Google-Workspace-Dienste"],"pt":["Exige autenticação de conta do Google para integração OAuth","Limitado apenas aos serviços do Google Workspace"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации учетной записи Google для интеграции OAuth","Ограничен только сервисами Google Workspace"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة حساب جوجل لدمج OAuth","محدود فقط بخدمات جوجل وورкспيس"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"73dc1dd97ecfd80f138600342875ecda78e91b4ddbac0403a225b4a4de65e04c","qualityScore":57}');
