":"GitHub 스킬은 OpenClaw 에이전트 워크스페이스의 기능으로 GitHub 리포지토리와 리소스에 대한 관리를 제공합니다","es":"GitHub Skill es un conjunto de herramientas de automatización modulares para GitHub","fr":"GitHub Skill est un ensemble d''outils d''automatisation modulaires pour GitHub","de":"GitHub Skill ist ein Satz modulare Automatisierungstools für GitHub","pt":"O que é GitHub Skill? É um invólucro do CLI do GitHub para gerenciar repositórios e fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агенты GitHub? Это оболочка CLI GitHub для управления репозиториями и рабочими процессами CI/CD","ar":"ما هي مهارة GitHub؟ هي غطاء لواجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub لإدارة المستودعات وتدفقات العمل في CI/CD"},"features":{"en":["Manages repositories using the GitHub CLI","Lists and views issues with `github issue list` and `github issue view` commands","Supports authentication with GitHub personal access tokens via `GITHUB_TOKEN` environment variable","Specifies default repositories using the `GH_REPO` environment variable","Automates CI/CD workflows and releases"],"zh":["仓库管理：创建、更新和删除仓库","问题跟踪：创建、更新和删除问题","拉取请求管理：创建、更新和删除拉取请求","CI/CD 工作流程管理：创建、更新和删除 CI/CD 工作流程","发布管理：创建、更新和删除发布"],"ja":["リポジトリ管理：リポジトリの作成、更新、削除","Issue 追跡：Issue の作成、更新、削除","プルリクエスト管理：プルリクエストの作成、更新、削除","CI/CD ワークフロー管理：CI/CD ワークフローの作成、更新、削除","リリース管理：リリースの作成、更新、削除"],"ko":["리포지토리 관리: 리포지토리 생성, 업데이트, 삭제","이슈 추적: 이슈 생성, 업데이트, 삭제","풀 리퀘스트 관리: 풀 리퀘스트 생성, 업데이트, 삭제","CI/CD 워크플ロー 관리: CI/CD 워크플로우 생성, 업데이트, 삭제","릴리스 관리: 릴리스 생성, 업데이트, 삭제"],"es":["Gestión de repositorios con GitHub CLI","Administración de problemas y solicitudes de extracción","Soporte para flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","Gestión de lanzamientos y versiones","Autenticación con token de acceso personal de GitHub","Compatibilidad con variables de entorno como GITHUB_TOKEN y GH_REPO"],"fr":["Gestion de référentiels avec GitHub CLI","Administration de problèmes et de demandes d''extraction","Prise en charge des flux de travail de CI/CD","Gestion de versions et de publications","Authentification avec jeton d''accès personnel de GitHub","Compatibilité avec des variables d''environnement comme GITHUB_TOKEN et GH_REPO"],"de":["Verwaltung von Repositorys mit GitHub CLI","Verwaltung von Problemen und Pull-Requests","Unterstützung für CI/CD-Workflows","Verwaltung von Releases und Versionen","Authentifizierung mit GitHub-Personalzugriffstoken","Kompatibilität mit Umgebungsvariablen wie GITHUB_TOKEN und GH_REPO"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de repositórios com CLI do GitHub","Listagem e visualização de problemas","Gerenciamento de solicitações de pull","Fluxos de trabalho de CI/CD","Lançamentos e gerenciamento de versões"],"ru":["Управление репозиториями с помощью CLI GitHub","Список и просмотр проблем","Управление запросами на включение","Рабочие процессы CI/CD","Выпуски и управление версиями"],"ar":["إدارة المستودعات مع واجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub","قائمة ومشاهدة المشاكل","إدارة طلبات السحب","عمليات العمل في CI/CD","الإصدارات وإدارة الإصدارات"]},"keywords":{"en":["github cli wrapper","how to use github cli","github alternative","github vs gitlab","github install guide","github setup for ai agents","github automation tools","github repository management"],"zh":["GitHub 技能","OpenClaw 代理工作空间","仓库管理","问题跟踪","拉取请求管理","CI/CD 工作流程管理","发布管理","GitHub CLI Wrapper"],"ja":["GitHub スキル","OpenClaw エージェントワークスペース","リポジトリ管理","Issue 追跡","プルリクエスト管理","CI/CD ワークフロー管理","リリース管理","GitHub CLI ラッパー","AIエージェント"],"ko":["GitHub 스킬","OpenClaw 에이전트 워크스페이스","리포지토리 관리","이슈 추적","풀 리퀘스트 관리","CI/CD 워크플ロー 관리","릴리스 관리","GitHub CLI Wrapper","AI 에이전트"],"es":["github skill","automatización de github","CLI de github","gestión de repositorios","problemas y solicitudes de extracción","flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","lanzamientos y versiones","token de acceso personal de github","herramientas de automatización modulares"],"fr":["github skill","automatisation de github","CLI de github","gestion de référentiels","problèmes et demandes d''extraction","flux de travail de CI/CD","versions et publications","jeton d''accès personnel de github","outils d''automatisation modulaires"],"de":["github skill","automatisierung von github","github cli","verwaltung von repositorys","probleme und pull-requests","ci/cd-workflows","releases und versionen","github-personalzugriffstoken","modulare automatisierungstools"],"pt":["github skill","cli do github","gerenciamento de repositórios","fluxos de trabalho de ci/cd","lançamentos github","desenvolvedores github","ferramentas de automação github"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты GitHub","CLI GitHub","Управление репозиториями","Рабочие процессы CI/CD","Выпуски GitHub","Разработчики GitHub","Инструменты автоматизации GitHub"],"ar":["مهارة GitHub","واجهة سطر الأوامر في GitHub","إدارة المستودعات","عمليات العمل في CI/CD","إصدارات GitHub","مطورو GitHub","أدوات آليّة في GitHub"]}},"owner":"Metavibez4L","repo":"openclaw-workspace","repoPath":"Metavibez4L/openclaw-workspace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T12:59:22.125Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github","description":"Comprehensive GitHub CLI wrapper. Manage repos, issues, PRs, workflows, releases, gists, and more via the gh CLI.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Skill\n\nFull-featured GitHub CLI wrapper for managing repositories, issues, pull requests, CI/CD workflows, releases, and more.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Required | Description |\n|----------|----------|-------------|\n| `GITHUB_TOKEN` | Optional | GitHub personal access token for authentication |\n| `GH_REPO` | Optional | Default repository (format: `owner/repo`) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Issues\ngithub issue list --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue view 42 --repo owner/repo","body":"# GitHub Skill\n\nFull-featured GitHub CLI wrapper for managing repositories, issues, pull requests, CI/CD workflows, releases, and more.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Required | Description |\n|----------|----------|-------------|\n| `GITHUB_TOKEN` | Optional | GitHub personal access token for authentication |\n| `GH_REPO` | Optional | Default repository (format: `owner/repo`) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Issues\ngithub issue list --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue view 42 --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue create --repo owner/repo --title \"Bug\" --body \"Details...\"\n\n# Pull Requests\ngithub pr list --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr merge 55 --repo owner/repo --squash\n\n# CI/CD Workflows\ngithub run list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\ngithub run view 12345678 --repo owner/repo --log-failed\ngithub run watch 12345678 --repo owner/repo\n\n# Releases\ngithub release list --repo owner/repo\ngithub release create v1.0.0 --repo owner/repo --title \"Version 1.0\"\n\n# Search\ngithub search repos \"topic:ai language:typescript\"\ngithub search code \"function authenticate repo:owner/repo\"\ngithub search issues \"is:open label:bug\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Repository Commands\n\n### View Repository Info\n```bash\ngithub repo view owner/repo\ngithub repo view owner/repo --json name,description,stargazers_count\n```\n\n### List Your Repositories\n```bash\ngithub repo list\ngithub repo list --limit 50 --source  # exclude forks\n```\n\n### Clone a Repository\n```bash\ngithub repo clone https://github.com/owner/repo\ngithub repo clone owner/repo my-local-name\n```\n\n### Fork a Repository\n```bash\ngithub repo fork owner/repo\ngithub repo fork owner/repo --clone --remote\n```\n\n---\n\n## Issue Commands\n\n### List Issues\n```bash\ngithub issue list --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue list --repo owner/repo --state all --limit 20\ngithub issue list --repo owner/repo --label bug --label \"help wanted\"\n```\n\n### View Issue Details\n```bash\ngithub issue view 42 --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue view 42 --repo owner/repo --comments\n```\n\n### Create an Issue\n```bash\ngithub issue create --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue create --repo owner/repo --title \"Found a bug\" --body \"Description...\"\ngithub issue create --repo owner/repo --title \"Bug\" --label bug --assignee @me\n```\n\n### Manage Issues\n```bash\ngithub issue close 42 --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue reopen 42 --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue comment 42 --repo owner/repo \"Thanks for reporting!\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Pull Request Commands\n\n### List PRs\n```bash\ngithub pr list --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr list --repo owner/repo --state merged --limit 10\ngithub pr list --repo owner/repo --author username\n```\n\n### View PR Details\n```bash\ngithub pr view 55 --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr view 55 --repo owner/repo --json number,title,state,mergeStateStatus\n```\n\n### Check PR CI Status\n```bash\ngithub pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo --json state,name\n```\n\n### Create a PR\n```bash\ngithub pr create --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr create --repo owner/repo --title \"Fix bug\" --body \"Description...\"\ngithub pr create --repo owner/repo --draft --base main\n```\n\n### Merge a PR\n```bash\ngithub pr merge 55 --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr merge 55 --repo owner/repo --squash --delete-branch\ngithub pr merge 55 --repo owner/repo --rebase --auto\n```\n\n### Review a PR\n```bash\ngithub pr review 55 --repo owner/repo --approve\ngithub pr review 55 --repo owner/repo --request-changes --body \"Needs work\"\ngithub pr review 55 --repo owner/repo --comment --body \"Question about...\"\n```\n\n### Checkout a PR Locally\n```bash\ngithub pr checkout 55 --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr checkout 55 --repo owner/repo --branch pr-55\n```\n\n### View PR Diff\n```bash\ngithub pr diff 55 --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr diff 55 --repo owner/repo --name-only\n```\n\n### Close a PR\n```bash\ngithub pr close 55 --repo owner/repo\ngithub pr close 55 --repo owner/repo --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Commands\n\n### List Recent Runs\n```bash\ngithub run list --repo owner/repo\ngithub run list --repo owner/repo --workflow ci.yml --limit 20\n```\n\n### View Run Details\n```bash\ngithub run view 12345678 --repo owner/repo\ngithub run view 12345678 --repo owner/repo --json conclusion,status\n```\n\n### View Run Logs\n```bash\ngithub run logs 12345678 --repo owner/repo\ngithub run failed 12345678 --repo owner/repo  # Failed steps only\n```\n\n### Watch Run Progress\n```bash\ngithub run watch 12345678 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n### Rerun or Cancel\n```bash\ngithub run rerun 12345678 --repo owner/repo\ngithub run rerun 12345678 --repo owner/repo --failed  # Rerun failed jobs only\ngithub run cancel 12345678 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n---\n\n## Release Commands\n\n### List Releases\n```bash\ngithub release list --repo owner/repo\ngithub release list --repo owner/repo --limit 10\n```\n\n### View a Release\n```bash\ngithub release view v1.0.0 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n### Create a Release\n```bash\ngithub release create v1.0.0 --repo owner/repo\ngithub release create v1.0.0 --repo owner/repo --title \"Version 1.0\" --notes \"Changes...\"\ngithub release create v1.0.0 --repo owner/repo --generate-notes --prerelease\n```\n\n### Upload Assets\n```bash\ngithub release upload v1.0.0 --repo owner/repo ./dist/app.zip\n```\n\n### Download Release Assets\n```bash\ngithub release download v1.0.0 --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n---\n\n## Gist Commands\n\n### List Your Gists\n```bash\ngithub gist list\ngithub gist list --limit 20 --public\n```\n\n### View a Gist\n```bash\ngithub gist view GIST_ID\ngithub gist view GIST_ID --raw\n```\n\n### Create a Gist\n```bash\ngithub gist create file.txt\ngithub gist create file.txt --public --desc \"My snippet\"\ngithub gist create \"*.md\" --desc \"Documentation snippets\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Search Commands\n\n### Search Repositories\n```bash\ngithub search repos \"machine learning\"\ngithub search repos \"topic:ai language:python stars:>1000\"\ngithub search repos \"org:facebook react\"\n```\n\n### Search Code\n```bash\ngithub search code \"function authenticate\"\ngithub search code \"TODO filename:main.go repo:owner/repo\"\ngithub search code \"class User language:typescript\"\n```\n\n### Search Issues\n```bash\ngithub search issues \"is:open label:bug\"\ngithub search issues \"created:>2024-01-01 repo:owner/repo\"\ngithub search issues \"involves:username state:closed\"\n```\n\n### Search Pull Requests\n```bash\ngithub search prs \"is:open is:pr review:required\"\ngithub search prs \"is:merged base:main author:username\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## API Commands\n\n### Direct API Calls\n```bash\ngithub api repos/owner/repo/pulls/55\ngithub api repos/owner/repo/issues --jq ''.[].title''\ngithub api repos/owner/repo/pulls/55 --method PATCH --field state=closed\n```\n\n### GraphQL Queries\n```bash\ngithub api-graphql ''query { viewer { login name } }''\n```\n\n### Common API Patterns\n\nGet PR with specific fields:\n```bash\ngithub api repos/owner/repo/pulls/55 --jq ''.title, .state, .user.login, .merged''\n```\n\nGet repository statistics:\n```bash\ngithub api repos/owner/repo --jq ''.stargazers_count, .forks_count, .open_issues_count''\n```\n\nList collaborators:\n```bash\ngithub api repos/owner/repo/collaborators --jq ''.[].login''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Authentication Commands\n\n### Check Status\n```bash\ngithub auth status\ngithub whoami\n```\n\n### Login\n```bash\ngithub auth login\n```\n\n### Get Token\n```bash\ngithub auth token\n```\n\n### Check Rate Limits\n```bash\ngithub rate-limit\n```\n\n---\n\n## JSON Output & Filtering\n\nMost commands support `--json` for structured output and `--jq` for filtering:\n\n```bash\n# Get specific fields as JSON\ngithub pr list --repo owner/repo --json number,title,author,state\n\n# Filter and format with jq\ngithub issue list --repo owner/repo --json number,title --jq ''.[] | \"#\\(.number): \\(.title)\"''\n\n# Complex jq filtering\ngithub run list --repo owner/repo --json name,status,conclusion --jq ''.[] | select(.conclusion==\"failure\") | .name''\n```\n\n---\n\n## Tips & Best Practices\n\n### Set Default Repository\nAvoid typing `--repo` repeatedly:\n```bash\nexport GH_REPO=\"owner/repo\"\ngithub pr list  # uses default repo\ngithub issue list  # uses default repo\n```\n\n### Combine with Other Tools\n```bash\n# Get failing PRs\ngithub pr list --repo owner/repo --json number,title,statusCheckRollup | jq ''.[] | select(.statusCheckRollup[].state==\"FAILURE\")''\n\n# Open PR in browser\ngithub pr view 55 --repo owner/repo --web\n```\n\n### Common Workflows\n\n**Review and merge a passing PR:**\n```bash\ngithub pr checks 55 --repo owner/repo && \\\ngithub pr review 55 --repo owner/repo --approve && \\\ngithub pr merge 55 --repo owner/repo --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n**Quick bug fix workflow:**\n```bash\ngithub issue view 42 --repo owner/repo\ngithub issue close 42 --repo owner/repo --comment \"Fixed in PR #55\"\n```\n\n**Monitor deployment:**\n```bash\ngithub run list --repo owner/repo --workflow deploy.yml --limit 1\ngithub run watch <run-id> --repo owner/repo\n```\n\n---\n\n## Help\n\n```bash\ngithub help              # Show all commands\ngithub repo help         # Show repo subcommands\ngithub issue help        # Show issue subcommands\ngithub pr help           # Show PR subcommands\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:13:28.187Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced GitHub repository management and CI/CD workflow automation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 GitHub 仓库管理和 CI/CD 工作流自动化的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理と CI/CD ワークフローの自動化が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 GitHub 리포지토리 관리 및 CI/CD 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una gestión avanzada de repositorios de GitHub y automatización de flujos de trabajo de CI/CD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion avancée de référentiels GitHub et d''automatisation de flux de travail CI/CD.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine erweiterte Verwaltung von GitHub-Repositorys und eine Automatisierung von CI/CD-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de gerenciamento avançado de repositórios GitHub e automação de fluxo de trabalho CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется расширенное управление репозиториями GitHub и автоматизация рабочих процессов CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة متقدمة لمخزن GitHub وتأليف تدفق العمل CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage repositories, issues, and pull requests using the GitHub CLI, while also handling CI/CD workflows, releases, and more, all through a unified interface utilizing GitHub personal access tokens and repository specifications.","zh":"赋予代理管理仓库、问题和拉取请求的能力，使用 GitHub CLI，同时处理 CI/CD 工作流、版本和更多，所有这些都通过一个统一的接口，利用 GitHub 个人访问令牌和仓库规格。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub CLI を使用してリポジトリ、問題、プルリクエストを管理し、CI/CD ワークフロー、リリースなどを処理する能力を提供します。すべては、GitHub の個人用アクセストークンとリポジトリの仕様を使用した統一されたインターフェイスを通じて行われます。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub CLI를 사용하여 리포지토리, 문제 및 풀 요청을 관리할 수 있으며, CI/CD 워크플로, 릴리스 등도 처리할 수 있습니다. 모두 GitHub 개인 접근 토큰 및 리포지토리 사양을 사용하는 통합 인터페이스를 통해 수행됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar repositorios, problemas e solicitudes de extracción utilizando la GitHub CLI, mientras también maneja flujos de trabajo de CI/CD, versiones y más, todo a través de una interfaz unificada que utiliza tokens de acceso personal de GitHub y especificaciones de repositorio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des référentiels, des problèmes et des demandes d''extraction en utilisant la GitHub CLI, tout en gérant également des flux de travail CI/CD, des versions et plus encore, le tout via une interface unifiée utilisant des jetons d''accès personnel GitHub et des spécifications de référentiel.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Repositorys, Probleme und Pull-Anfragen über die GitHub-CLI zu verwalten, während auch CI/CD-Workflows, Releases und mehr über eine einheitliche Schnittstelle verwaltet werden, die GitHub-Personalaccess-Tokens und Repository-Spezifikationen verwendet.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem repositórios, problemas e solicitações de pull usando o GitHub CLI, além de lidar com fluxos de trabalho CI/CD, lançamentos e muito mais, tudo por meio de uma interface unificada que utiliza tokens de acesso pessoal do GitHub e especificações de repositório.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять репозиториями, проблемами и запросами на включение с помощью GitHub CLI, а также обрабатывать рабочие процессы CI/CD, релизы и многое другое, все через унифицированный интерфейс, использующий личные токены доступа GitHub и спецификации репозитория.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إدارة مخازن و مشاكل وطلبات سحب باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر GitHub، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع تدفقات العمل CI/CD وال 版، وغيرها من الأمور، كل ذلك من خلال واجهة موحدة تستخدم رموز الوصول الشخصية لمستودع GitHub ومواصفاته."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue tracking and management","Generating release notes and changelogs","Debugging CI/CD workflow failures"],"zh":["自动化问题跟踪和管理","生成发布说明和变更日志","调试 CI/CD 工作流失败"],"ja":["問題の追跡と管理の自動化","リリースノートと変更ログの生成","CI/CD ワークフローの故障のデバッグ"],"ko":["문제 추적 및 관리 자동화","릴리스 노트 및 변경 로그 생성","CI/CD 워크플로 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de seguimiento y gestión de problemas","Generación de notas de versión y registros de cambios","Depuración de fallos en flujos de trabajo de CI/CD"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion et du suivi des problèmes","Génération de notes de version et de journaux des modifications","Débogage des défaillances des flux de travail CI/CD"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verfolgung und Verwaltung von Problemen","Erstellung von Versionshinweisen und Änderungsprotokollen","Fehlerbehebung bei CI/CD-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar o rastreamento e gerenciamento de problemas","Gerar notas de lançamento e registros de alterações","Depurar falhas no fluxo de trabalho CI/CD"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание и управление проблемами","Генерировать заметки о выпуске и журналы изменений","Отладить сбои в рабочем процессе CI/CD"],"ar":["تأليف تتبع وإدارة المشاكل","توليد ملاحظات الإصدار وسجلات التغييرات","تصحيح أخطاء في تدفق العمل CI/CD"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub personal access token for authentication","Limited to GitHub repositories and workflows"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 个人访问令牌进行身份验证","仅限 GitHub 仓库和工作流"],"ja":["認証には GitHub の個人用アクセストークンが必要","GitHub リポジトリとワークフローのみに限定されています"],"ko":["인증에는 GitHub 개인 접근 토큰이 필요합니다","GitHub 리포지토리 및 워크플로에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere token de acceso personal de GitHub para la autenticación","Limitado a repositorios y flujos de trabajo de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''accès personnel GitHub pour l''authentification","Limité aux référentiels et flux de travail GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Personalaccess-Token für die Authentifizierung","Begrenzt auf GitHub-Repositorys und -Workflows"],"pt":["Requer token de acesso pessoal do GitHub para autenticação","Limitado a repositórios e fluxos de trabalho do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует личного токена доступа GitHub для аутентификации","Ограничен репозиториями и рабочими процессами GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز الوصول الشخصي لمستودع GitHub للتأكيد","محدود بمخازن وعمليات تدفق العمل لمستودع GitHub"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7114fd5b3ac5a9ec6d69c79e15b3b4eb3acfb9544667b28d15dbaa2ed79d1e6d","qualityScore":57}');
