de Code対応"],"ko":["구조화된 규격","TDD 사이클","피드백 루프","스킬 시스템","Claude Code 지원"],"es":["Desarrollo dirigido por documentos","Especificaciones estructuradas","Ciclos de TDD","Sistema de habilidades","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["Développement piloté par des documents","Spécifications structurées","Cycles de TDD","Système de compétences","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["Dokumentengetriebene Entwicklung","Strukturierte Spezifikationen","TDD-Zyklen","Fähigkeitensystem","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento orientado a documentos","Especificações estruturadas","Ciclos de TDD","Sistema de habilidades","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Разработка, ориентированная на документы","Структурированные спецификации","Циклы TDD","Система навыков","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام الوثائق","المواصفات المهيكلة","دورات التطوير المستندة إلى الاختبار","نظام المهارات","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能开发框架","如何使用backend-zod","什么是Document-Driven Development","backend-zod替代方案","backend-zod安装","Claude Code开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント開発フレームワーク","backend-zodの使い方","Document-Driven Developmentとは","backend-zodの代替","backend-zodのインストール","Claude Code開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 개발 프레임워크","backend-zod 사용법","문서 기반 개발이란","backend-zod 대안","backend-zod 설치","Claude Code 개발 도구"],"es":["cómo usar backend-zod","qué es el desarrollo dirigido por documentos","alternativas a backend-zod","backend-zod vs otros frameworks","instalación de backend-zod","guía de configuración de backend-zod","desarrollo de software con AI","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser backend-zod","qu''est-ce que le développement piloté par des documents","alternatives à backend-zod","backend-zod vs autres frameworks","installation de backend-zod","guide de configuration de backend-zod","développement de logiciels avec l''IA","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man backend-zod verwendet","was ist dokumentengetriebene Entwicklung","Alternative zu backend-zod","backend-zod vs andere Frameworks","Installation von backend-zod","Konfigurationsanleitung für backend-zod","Softwareentwicklung mit KI","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar backend-zod","o que é backend-zod","ferramentas de desenvolvimento backend","agentes de ia para desenvolvimento","backend-zod vs outras ferramentas","instalar backend-zod","guia de configuração do backend-zod"],"ru":["как использовать backend-zod","что такое backend-zod","инструменты разработки бэкенда","ИИ агенты для разработки","backend-zod vs другие инструменты","установить backend-zod","руководство по настройке backend-zod"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام backend-zod","ما هو backend-zod","أدوات تطوير التطبيقات الخلفية","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير التطبيقات","backend-zod مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت backend-zod","دليل إعداد backend-zod"]}},"owner":"petbrains","repo":"mvp-builder","repoPath":"petbrains/mvp-builder","stars":9,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T14:57:05Z","topics":["ai-agents","automation","claude-code","code-generator","developer-tools","document-driven-development","llm","mvp","prompt-engineering","spec-driven","tdd"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backend-zod","description":"TypeScript-first schema validation library. Use for ALL input validation in TypeScript projects — API inputs, form data, environment variables, config files. Essential companion for tRPC (required), React Hook Form, and any data boundary. Choose Zod when you need runtime validation with automatic TypeScript type inference.","bodyPreview":"# Zod (Schema Validation)\n\n## Overview\n\nZod is a TypeScript-first schema declaration and validation library. Define a schema once, get both runtime validation AND TypeScript types automatically via `z.infer<>`.\n\n**Version**: Zod 4 (2025) / Zod 3.x widely used  \n**Requirements**: TypeScript ≥5.5, strict mode\n\n**Key Benefit**: Single source of truth for validation and types — no drift between runtime checks and TypeScript.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n✅ **Use Zod when:**\n- Validating API inputs (re","body":"# Zod (Schema Validation)\n\n## Overview\n\nZod is a TypeScript-first schema declaration and validation library. Define a schema once, get both runtime validation AND TypeScript types automatically via `z.infer<>`.\n\n**Version**: Zod 4 (2025) / Zod 3.x widely used  \n**Requirements**: TypeScript ≥5.5, strict mode\n\n**Key Benefit**: Single source of truth for validation and types — no drift between runtime checks and TypeScript.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n✅ **Use Zod when:**\n- Validating API inputs (required for tRPC)\n- Building forms with react-hook-form\n- Parsing environment variables\n- Validating config files or JSON\n- Creating DTOs between layers\n- Any data crossing trust boundaries\n\n❌ **Zod is NOT for:**\n- Complex business rule validation (use domain logic)\n- Database schema definition (use Prisma schema)\n- Static type-only definitions (use interfaces)\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install zod\n```\n\n### Basic Usage\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\n// Define schema\nconst UserSchema = z.object({\n  id: z.string().uuid(),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  age: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\n\n// Infer TypeScript type\ntype User = z.infer<typeof UserSchema>;\n\n// Validate\nconst result = UserSchema.safeParse(data);\nif (result.success) {\n  console.log(result.data); // typed as User\n} else {\n  console.log(result.error.issues);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Schema Patterns\n\n### Primitives with Validation\n\n```typescript\nconst EmailSchema = z.string().email(''Invalid email format'');\nconst PasswordSchema = z.string().min(8, ''Min 8 characters'');\nconst AgeSchema = z.number().int().positive().max(150);\nconst UrlSchema = z.string().url();\nconst UuidSchema = z.string().uuid();\n```\n\n### Object Schemas\n\n```typescript\nconst UserSchema = z.object({\n  id: z.string().uuid(),\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  name: z.string().min(2).max(100),\n  role: z.enum([''user'', ''admin'', ''moderator'']),\n  createdAt: z.date(),\n});\n\ntype User = z.infer<typeof UserSchema>;\n```\n\n### Derive Variations\n\n```typescript\n// For create (omit auto-generated fields)\nconst CreateUserSchema = UserSchema.omit({ id: true, createdAt: true });\n\n// For update (all optional)\nconst UpdateUserSchema = CreateUserSchema.partial();\n\n// For public response (only safe fields)\nconst PublicUserSchema = UserSchema.pick({ id: true, name: true });\n```\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### Discriminated Unions\n\n**Use for type-safe API responses:**\n\n```typescript\nconst ApiResponse = z.discriminatedUnion(''status'', [\n  z.object({ status: z.literal(''success''), data: UserSchema }),\n  z.object({ status: z.literal(''error''), code: z.string(), message: z.string() }),\n]);\n\ntype ApiResponse = z.infer<typeof ApiResponse>;\n// TypeScript knows: if status === ''success'', data exists\n```\n\n### Custom Validation with Refine\n\n```typescript\nconst PasswordSchema = z.string()\n  .min(8)\n  .refine(val => /[A-Z]/.test(val), ''Must contain uppercase'')\n  .refine(val => /[0-9]/.test(val), ''Must contain number'');\n```\n\n### Cross-Field Validation with SuperRefine\n\n```typescript\nconst FormSchema = z.object({\n  password: z.string(),\n  confirmPassword: z.string(),\n}).superRefine((data, ctx) => {\n  if (data.password !== data.confirmPassword) {\n    ctx.addIssue({\n      code: ''custom'',\n      message: ''Passwords must match'',\n      path: [''confirmPassword''],\n    });\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### Transforms (Data Normalization)\n\n```typescript\n// Normalize email\nconst NormalizedEmail = z.string()\n  .email()\n  .transform(s => s.toLowerCase().trim());\n\n// Parse string to number\nconst StringToNumber = z.string()\n  .transform(s => parseInt(s, 10))\n  .pipe(z.number());\n```\n\n### Coercion (API Query Parameters)\n\n```typescript\n// GET requests receive strings — use coercion\nconst PaginationSchema = z.object({\n  page: z.coerce.number().int().min(1).default(1),\n  limit: z.coerce.number().int().min(1).max(100).default(20),\n  active: z.coerce.boolean().optional(),\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Schema Recipes\n\n### Pagination Input\n\n```typescript\nexport const PaginationSchema = z.object({\n  limit: z.number().min(1).max(100).default(10),\n  cursor: z.string().uuid().optional(),\n});\n```\n\n### Date Range Filter\n\n```typescript\nexport const DateRangeSchema = z.object({\n  from: z.coerce.date(),\n  to: z.coerce.date(),\n}).refine(d => d.from <= d.to, ''From must be before To'');\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```typescript\nconst EnvSchema = z.object({\n  NODE_ENV: z.enum([''development'', ''production'', ''test'']),\n  DATABASE_URL: z.string().url(),\n  JWT_SECRET: z.string().min(32),\n  PORT: z.coerce.number().default(3000),\n});\n\nexport const env = EnvSchema.parse(process.env);\n```\n\n### File Upload Metadata\n\n```typescript\nconst FileSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string(),\n  size: z.number().max(10 * 1024 * 1024), // 10MB\n  type: z.enum([''image/png'', ''image/jpeg'', ''application/pdf'']),\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration with tRPC\n\n```typescript\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { publicProcedure } from ''../trpc'';\n\nconst CreateUserSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  name: z.string().min(2),\n});\n\nexport const userRouter = router({\n  create: publicProcedure\n    .input(CreateUserSchema)  // ← Zod validates automatically\n    .mutation(({ input }) => {\n      // input is typed as { email: string; name: string }\n    }),\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n### Do ✅\n\n- Use `z.infer<typeof Schema>` to derive types\n- Use discriminated unions over regular unions for objects\n- Use `.safeParse()` when handling errors gracefully\n- Add descriptive error messages\n- Use `.default()` for optional fields with defaults\n- Keep schemas in dedicated files (`/schemas/*.schema.ts`)\n\n### Avoid ❌\n\n- Async transforms in tRPC input (not supported)\n- Using `.catchall()` with output schemas (inference issues)\n- Multiple Zod installations (causes type inference failures)\n- Overly complex nested refinements (hard to debug)\n\n---\n\n## Parse Methods\n\n| Method | Throws | Returns |\n|--------|--------|---------|\n| `.parse(data)` | Yes | `T` |\n| `.safeParse(data)` | No | `{ success, data?, error? }` |\n| `.parseAsync(data)` | Yes | `Promise<T>` |\n| `.safeParseAsync(data)` | No | `Promise<{ success, data?, error? }>` |\n\n**Use `.safeParse()` in application code, `.parse()` in trusted contexts.**\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n```yaml\n\"Type inference not working\":\n  → Check single Zod installation: npm ls zod\n  → Ensure TypeScript strict mode enabled\n  → Restart TypeScript server\n\n\"Coercion not working\":\n  → Use z.coerce.number() not z.number() for query params\n  → Check input is string before coercion\n\n\"Transform output type wrong\":\n  → Use .pipe() after transform for additional validation\n  → Check transform return type\n\n\"Refinement errors unclear\":\n  → Add path parameter to ctx.addIssue()\n  → Use descriptive error messages\n```\n\n---\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\nsrc/schemas/\n├── user.schema.ts       # User-related schemas\n├── post.schema.ts       # Post-related schemas\n├── common.schema.ts     # Pagination, date ranges, etc.\n└── env.schema.ts        # Environment validation\n```\n\n## References\n\n- https://zod.dev — Official documentation\n- https://zod.dev/?id=basic-usage — Quick reference\n- https://github.com/colinhacks/zod — GitHub\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:34:58.882Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing robust schema validation and type inference, such as Claude Code and AutoGPT.","zh":"适用于需要强大的模式验证和类型推断的TypeScript-based AI代理，例如Claude Code和AutoGPT。","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントでロバストなスキーマ検証と型推論を必要とする場合、例えばClaude CodeやAutoGPTに適しています。","ko":"강력한 스키마 유효성 검사 및 타입 추론이 필요한 TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en TypeScript que necesitan una validación de esquema robusta y una inferencia de tipos, como Claude Code y AutoGPT.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur TypeScript nécessitant une validation de schéma robuste et une inférence de types, tels que Claude Code et AutoGPT.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents, die eine robuste Schemavalidierung und eine Typinferenz benötigen, wie Claude Code und AutoGPT.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que necessitam de validação de esquema robusta e inferência de tipo, como Claude Code e AutoGPT.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, которым требуется надежная валидация схем и вывод типа, такие как Claude Code и AutoGPT.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يستند إلى TypeScript والذي يحتاج إلى التحقق من صحة مخطط قوي واستنتاج نوع، مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define schemas once and get both runtime validation and TypeScript types automatically via z.infer<>, ensuring a single source of truth for validation and types with libraries like Zod 4 and strict mode TypeScript.","zh":"赋予代理一次定义模式就能通过z.infer<>同时获得运行时验证和TypeScript类型，确保使用类似Zod 4和严格模式TypeScript的库进行验证和类型的单一真实来源。","ja":"エージェントが一度スキーマを定義すると、z.infer<>を介して同時にランタイム検証とTypeScriptの型を取得できるようにし、Zod 4や厳格モードのTypeScriptなどのライブラリを使用して検証と型の単一の真実の源を保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 스키마를 한 번 정의하면 z.infer<>를 통해 동시에 런타임 유효성 검사 및 TypeScript 타입을 얻을 수 있도록 하여, Zod 4 및 엄격 모드 TypeScript와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 유효성 검사 및 타입의 단일 진실을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir esquemas una sola vez y obtener tanto la validación en tiempo de ejecución como los tipos TypeScript automáticamente a través de z.infer<>, asegurando una sola fuente de verdad para la validación y los tipos con bibliotecas como Zod 4 y el modo estricto de TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des schémas une seule fois et d''obtenir à la fois la validation à l''exécution et les types TypeScript automatiquement via z.infer<>, en garantissant une seule source de vérité pour la validation et les types avec des bibliothèques comme Zod 4 et le mode strict de TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Schemata einmal zu definieren und sowohl die Laufzeitvalidierung als auch die TypeScript-Typen automatisch über z.infer<> zu erhalten, wodurch eine einzelne Wahrheitsquelle für Validierung und Typen mit Bibliotheken wie Zod 4 und dem Strict-Modus von TypeScript sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes definam esquemas uma vez e obtenham validação em tempo de execução e tipos TypeScript automaticamente via z.infer<>, garantindo uma única fonte de verdade para validação e tipos com bibliotecas como Zod 4 e modo estrito TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять схемы один раз и получать проверку в runtime и типы TypeScript автоматически через z.infer<>, обеспечивая единственный источник правды для проверки и типов с помощью библиотек, таких как Zod 4 и строгий режим TypeScript.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تحديد مخططات مرة واحدة والحصول على التحقق من الصحة في وقت التشغيل وأنواع TypeScript تلقائياً عبر z.infer<>, مما يضمن مصدراً وحيداً للصحة للتحقق من الصحة وأنواع مع مكتبات مثل Zod 4 ووضع TypeScript الصارم."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating API inputs with Zod schemas","Generating TypeScript types for API responses","Implementing document-driven development with structured specs and TDD cycles"],"zh":["使用Zod模式验证API输入","为API响应生成TypeScript类型","实现文档驱动的开发，具有结构化规格和TDD周期"],"ja":["Zodスキーマを使用してAPI入力を検証する","APIレスポンスのTypeScript型を生成する","構造化された仕様とTDDサイクルを備えたドキュメント主導の開発を実装する"],"ko":["Zod 스키마를 사용하여 API 입력을 유효성 검사하는 것","API 응답을 위한 TypeScript 타입을 생성하는 것","구조화된 규격 및 TDD 주기를 갖춘 문서 주도 개발을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Validar las entradas de la API con esquemas Zod","Generar tipos TypeScript para respuestas de la API","Implementar el desarrollo dirigido por documentos con especificaciones estructuradas y ciclos de TDD"],"fr":["Valider les entrées de l''API avec des schémas Zod","Générer des types TypeScript pour les réponses de l''API","Mettre en œuvre le développement dirigé par des documents avec des spécifications structurées et des cycles de TDD"],"de":["API-Eingaben mit Zod-Schemata validieren","TypeScript-Typen für API-Antworten generieren","Dokumentengetriebene Entwicklung mit strukturierten Spezifikationen und TDD-Zyklen implementieren"],"pt":["Validar entradas de API com esquemas Zod","Gerar tipos TypeScript para respostas de API","Implementar desenvolvimento orientado a documentos com specs estruturadas e ciclos TDD"],"ru":["Проверять входные данные API с помощью схем Zod","Генерировать типы TypeScript для ответов API","Реализовывать разработку, ориентированную на документы, со структурированными спецификациями и циклами TDD"],"ar":["التحقق من مدخلات API باستخدام مخططات Zod","توليد أنواع TypeScript لاستجابات API","تنفيذ تطوير استناداً إلى الوثائق مع مواصفات منظمة ودورات TDD"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript version 5.5 or higher","Strict mode must be enabled","Compatibility limited to Zod 3.x and Zod 4"],"zh":["需要TypeScript版本5.5或更高","必须启用严格模式","兼容性仅限于Zod 3.x和Zod 4"],"ja":["TypeScriptバージョン5.5以上が必要","厳格モードを有効にする必要がある","Zod 3.xとZod 4への互換性のみ"],"ko":["TypeScript 버전 5.5 이상이 필요함","엄격 모드를 활성화해야 함","Zod 3.x 및 Zod 4와의 호환성만 제공"],"es":["Requiere la versión 5.5 o superior de TypeScript","El modo estricto debe estar habilitado","Compatibilidad limitada a Zod 3.x y Zod 4"],"fr":["Nécessite la version 5.5 ou supérieure de TypeScript","Le mode strict doit être activé","Compatibilité limitée à Zod 3.x et Zod 4"],"de":["Benötigt TypeScript-Version 5.5 oder höher","Der Strict-Modus muss aktiviert sein","Kompatibilität beschränkt auf Zod 3.x und Zod 4"],"pt":["Requer versão 5.5 ou superior do TypeScript","O modo estrito deve ser ativado","Compatibilidade limitada ao Zod 3.x e Zod 4"],"ru":["Требуется версия 5.5 или выше TypeScript","Строгий режим должен быть включен","Совместимость ограничена Zod 3.x и Zod 4"],"ar":["يتطلب الإصدار 5.5 أو أعلى من TypeScript","يجب تمكين الوضع الصارم","التوافق مقيد بالزود 3.x والزود 4"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"abee72b270f2907b4ad816ebaa94b409cd9e78096b63ba92ea776531d669f8d4","qualityScore":57}');
