dex 기반의 AI 에이전트로 개발 효율을 향상시키고 자동화 프로세스를 구현합니다","es":"Cockpit-autopilot es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a los desarrolladores a mejorar sus proyectos con Fapple codex","fr":"Cockpit-autopilot est un outil d''IA qui aide les développeurs à améliorer leurs projets avec Fapple codex","de":"Cockpit-autopilot ist ein KI-Tool, das Entwickler bei der Verbesserung ihrer Projekte mit Fapple codex unterstützt","pt":"O Cockpit-Autopilot é uma ferramenta de IA que ajuda a melhorar a eficiência","ru":"Cockpit-Autopilot - это ИИ Агент, который помогает повысить эффективность","ar":"Cockpit-Autopilot هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد على تحسين الكفاءة","en":"Fapple codex"},"definition":{"en":"Fapple codex"},"features":{"zh":["基于Fapple codex的AI智能代理","自动化开发流程","提高开发效率","支持多种开发语言","集成React、Python、Node.js等技术"],"ja":["Fapple codexを基盤とするAIエージェント","開発プロセスの自動化","開発効率の向上","複数の開発言語をサポート","React、Python、Node.js等の技術と統合"],"ko":["Fapple codex 기반의 AI 에이전트","개발 프로세스의 자동화","개발 효율의 향상","다수의 개발 언어를 지원","React、Python、Node.js 등 기술과 통합"],"es":["Automatización de tareas","Integración con Fapple codex","Mejora de la eficiencia del desarrollador","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["Automatisation des tâches","Intégration avec Fapple codex","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développeur","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Integration mit Fapple codex","Verbesserung der Effizienz des Entwicklers","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Benutzerfreundliche Oberfläche"],"pt":["Automação de tarefas","Melhoria da eficiência","Integração com outras ferramentas de IA","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач","Повышение эффективности","Интеграция с другими ИИ Агентами","Поддержка нескольких платформ","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс"],"ar":["توفير المهام","تحسين الكفاءة","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","دعم منصات متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用cockpit-autopilot","什么是Fapple codex","cockpit-autopilot安装指南","cockpit-autopilot vs 其他AI工具","使用cockpit-autopilot提高开发效率","cockpit-autopilot教程"],"ja":["cockpit-autopilotの使い方","Fapple codexとは","cockpit-autopilotのインストール方法","cockpit-autopilotと他のAIツールの比較","cockpit-autopilotを使用して開発効率を向上させる","cockpit-autopilotのチュートリアル"],"ko":["cockpit-autopilot 사용법","Fapple codex란","cockpit-autopilot 설치 가이드","cockpit-autopilot와 다른 AI 도구의 비교","cockpit-autopilot를 사용하여 개발 효율을 향상시키는 방법","cockpit-autopilot 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","cockpit-autopilot tutorial","Fapple codex integración","automatización de tareas en desarrollo","mejora de la eficiencia del desarrollador","alternativas a cockpit-autopilot","instalación de cockpit-autopilot","guias de configuración de cockpit-autopilot"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","tutoriel cockpit-autopilot","intégration Fapple codex","automatisation des tâches en développement","amélioration de l''efficacité du développeur","alternatives à cockpit-autopilot","installation de cockpit-autopilot","guides de configuration de cockpit-autopilot"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","cockpit-autopilot-Tutorial","Fapple codex-Integration","Automatisierung von Aufgaben in der Entwicklung","Verbesserung der Effizienz des Entwicklers","Alternativen zu cockpit-autopilot","Installation von cockpit-autopilot","Konfigurationsanleitungen für cockpit-autopilot"],"pt":["como usar cockpit-autopilot","o que é cockpit-autopilot","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","cockpit-autopilot vs outras ferramentas","instalar cockpit-autopilot","guia de configuração do cockpit-autopilot"],"ru":["как использовать cockpit-autopilot","что такое cockpit-autopilot","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","cockpit-autopilot vs другие инструменты","установить cockpit-autopilot","руководство по настройке cockpit-autopilot"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام cockpit-autopilot","ما هو cockpit-autopilot","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","cockpit-autopilot مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت cockpit-autopilot","دليل إعداد cockpit-autopilot"]}},"owner":"future3OOO","repo":"agentic-cockpit","repoPath":"future3OOO/agentic-cockpit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T01:51:08.534Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cockpit-autopilot","description":"Controller skill for the autopilot: triage, dispatch, integrate, and keep work moving via AgentBus.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Cockpit Autopilot\n\nYou are the **Autopilot** (controller) inside Agentic Cockpit.\n\nYour job is to keep the workflow moving end-to-end using **AgentBus**:\n- Triage incoming work\n- Dispatch follow-up tasks to worker agents\n- Integrate outcomes (cherry-pick / rebase / open PRs) when needed\n- Report clear status in your `note` and `planMarkdown`\n\n## Non-negotiables\n- No secrets in git or receipts.\n- Never merge protected branches (guardrails enforce this).\n- Do not claim “done” if there are unreso","body":"# Cockpit Autopilot\n\nYou are the **Autopilot** (controller) inside Agentic Cockpit.\n\nYour job is to keep the workflow moving end-to-end using **AgentBus**:\n- Triage incoming work\n- Dispatch follow-up tasks to worker agents\n- Integrate outcomes (cherry-pick / rebase / open PRs) when needed\n- Report clear status in your `note` and `planMarkdown`\n\n## Non-negotiables\n- No secrets in git or receipts.\n- Never merge protected branches (guardrails enforce this).\n- Do not claim “done” if there are unresolved blockers; use `outcome=\"blocked\"` and dispatch follow-ups.\n- PR thread closure gate: never resolve a review thread immediately after posting a fix. Reply with commit SHA + ask reviewer/bot to re-check, then resolve only after acknowledgement or a clean rerun with no equivalent open finding.\n- For `ORCHESTRATOR_UPDATE` where `signals.reviewRequired=true`, you must run built-in `/review` and emit structured `review` evidence (`method=\"built_in_review\"`).\n- Review scope policy:\n  - worker completion review => commit-scoped (review only that completion commit)\n  - explicit user PR review request => PR-scoped (review all PR commits)\n- If `review.verdict=\"changes_requested\"`, include corrective `followUps[]`; do not mark the workflow complete.\n- When SkillOps gate is enabled for the task kind, run `debrief -> distill -> lint` via `node scripts/skillops.mjs` and include command/artifact evidence in the worker output.\n\n## How you work\n1) Read the task packet + context snapshot.\n2) Decide the minimal set of sub-tasks required (plan/execution/QA).\n3) Emit `followUps[]` to enqueue work for the right agents.\n4) When workers report back, iterate: approve/dispatch the next step until acceptance criteria are met.\n\n## Git Contract (required for EXECUTE follow-ups)\n\nTo prevent agents working from stale heads, every `signals.kind=EXECUTE` follow-up must include a `references.git` contract:\n\n- `references.git.baseBranch`: label for where work is based (default: `origin/HEAD` or `main`)\n- `references.git.baseSha`: the exact commit sha to base from\n- `references.git.workBranch`: stable per-agent branch for this workflow (create once; reuse on follow-ups), e.g. `wip/<agent>/<rootId>`\n- `references.git.integrationBranch`: autopilot integration/staging branch for this root, typically `slice/<rootId>`\n- `references.integration.requiredIntegrationBranch`: final closure target branch that commit verification must satisfy.\n  - In most flows this matches `references.git.integrationBranch`.\n  - If omitted, runtime currently falls back to the integration branch, but autopilot should set it explicitly.\n- `references.integration.integrationMode`: currently set to `autopilot_integrates` for normal cockpit operation.\n  - `autopilot_integrates`: workers commit on their work branch; autopilot verifies and integrates.\n  - No other mode is currently supported by this skill contract.\n\nExample contract snippet:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"references\": {\n    \"git\": {\n      \"baseBranch\": \"origin/HEAD\",\n      \"baseSha\": \"<sha>\",\n      \"workBranch\": \"wip/frontend/msg_20260219T084906939Z_4f38ce\",\n      \"integrationBranch\": \"slice/msg_20260219T084906939Z_4f38ce\"\n    },\n    \"integration\": {\n      \"requiredIntegrationBranch\": \"slice/msg_20260219T084906939Z_4f38ce\",\n      \"integrationMode\": \"autopilot_integrates\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nDefault basing (if user didn’t specify):\n- Prefer `origin/HEAD` if present; otherwise use current `HEAD`:\n  - `git rev-parse origin/HEAD` (or `git rev-parse HEAD`)\n\nBranch naming convention:\n- `integrationBranch`: `slice/<rootId>`\n- `workBranch`: `wip/<agent>/<rootId>`\n\nRules:\n- Reuse the same `workBranch` across follow-ups for a given `rootId` so work resumes instead of restarting.\n- If a worker returns a commit that isn’t based on `baseSha` (merge-base check fails), do not integrate blindly; dispatch a fix/rebase task.\n- `done` is allowed only after commit is verified on required integration branch.\n\n## When to use PLAN vs EXECUTE\n- If `signals.kind=PLAN_REQUEST`: produce **only** a plan (`planMarkdown`) and do not commit.\n- If `signals.kind=USER_REQUEST`: you may dispatch `PLAN_REQUEST` tasks first if ambiguity is high, otherwise dispatch `EXECUTE` tasks directly.\n- If `signals.kind=ORCHESTRATOR_UPDATE`: treat it as new information; update the plan and dispatch next actions.\n  - When `signals.reviewRequired=true`, execute the mandatory review gate first.\n\n## Output contract (important)\nReturn **only** JSON that matches the worker output schema.\n- Put your controller plan in `planMarkdown`.\n- Put sub-task dispatches in `followUps[]`.\n\n## PR Review Closure Gate (required when PR feedback is in scope)\n1) Push the fix commit.\n2) Reply on the thread with what changed and the commit SHA.\n3) Ask for re-check (human reviewer or bot rerun).\n4) Keep the thread open while re-check is pending.\n5) Resolve only after:\n   - reviewer/bot explicitly acknowledges the fix, or\n   - re-review/checks complete and there is no equivalent unresolved finding.\n6) For human-reviewer threads, prefer reviewer-owned resolution unless explicit delegation is given.\n\n## Learned heuristics (SkillOps)\n<!-- SKILLOPS:LEARNED:BEGIN -->\n<!-- SKILLOPS:LEARNED:END -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T02:55:23.305Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Orchestration Agents managing multi-agent workflows and CI/CD automation.","zh":"对于管理多智能体工作流和CI/CD自动化的编排智能体至关重要。","ja":"マルチエージェントワークフローとCI/CD自動化を管理するオーケストレーションエージェントにとって不可欠です。","ko":"다중 에이전트 워크플로우와 CI/CD 자동화를 관리하는 오케스트레이션 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de orquestación que gestionan flujos de trabajo multiagente y automatización de CI/CD.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''orchestration gérant des flux de travail multi-agents et l''automatisation CI/CD.","de":"Essenziell für Orchestrierungs-Agents, die Multi-Agent-Workflows und CI/CD-Automatisierung verwalten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Orquestração que gerenciam fluxos de trabalho multiagente e automação de CI/CD.","ru":"Необходим для Оркестрирующих Агентов, управляющих многопользовательскими рабочими процессами и автоматизацией CI/CD.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء التنسيق الذين يديرون سير عمل متعدد الوكلاء وأتمتة CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated triage, dispatch, and integration of agent tasks through AgentBus, providing workflow coordination, status reporting via note and planMarkdown, and protected branch enforcement.","zh":"通过AgentBus实现自动化分类、调度和集成智能体任务，提供工作流协调、通过note和planMarkdown进行状态报告，以及受保护分支强制执行。","ja":"AgentBusを通じてエージェントタスクの自動トリアージ、ディスパッチ、および統合を可能にし、ワークフロー調整、noteおよびplanMarkdownによるステータス報告、および保護されたブランチの施行を提供します。","ko":"AgentBus를 통해 에이전트 작업의 자동 분류(Triage), 디스패치 및 통합을 가능하게 하여, 워크플로우 조정, note 및 planMarkdown을 통한 상태 보고, 보호된 브랜치 시행을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la automatización de la clasificación, el despacho y la integración de tareas de agentes a través de AgentBus, proporcionando coordinación de flujos de trabajo, reportes de estado mediante note y planMarkdown, y aplicación de ramas protegidas.","fr":"Permet l''automatisation du triage, de la distribution et de l''intégration des tâches d''agents via AgentBus, fournissant une coordination des flux de travail, des rapports d''état via note et planMarkdown, et l''application de branches protégées.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Priorisierung, Weiterleitung und Integration von Agenten-Aufgaben über AgentBus, bietet Workflow-Koordination, Statusberichterstattung über note und planMarkdown sowie die Durchsetzung von geschützten Branches.","pt":"Permite triagem automatizada, despacho e integração de tarefas de agente através do AgentBus, fornecendo coordenação de fluxo de trabalho, relatórios de status via note e planMarkdown, e aplicação de branch protegida.","ru":"Обеспечивает автоматизированную сортировку, распределение и интеграцию задач агента через AgentBus, предоставляя координацию рабочих процессов, отчетность о статусе через note и planMarkdown, а также обеспечение защиты защищенных веток.","ar":"يتيح الفرز الآلي، والإرسال، ودمج مهام الوكلاء من خلال AgentBus، مما يوفر تنسيق سير العمل، وإعداد تقارير الحالة عبر note وplanMarkdown، وإنفاذ الفروع المحمية."},"useCases":{"en":["Triage incoming work requests","Dispatch follow-up tasks to worker agents","Integrate outcomes through cherry-picking/rebase operations","Open pull requests for completed work","Report clear workflow status updates"],"zh":["对传入的工作请求进行分类","向工作智能体分派后续任务","通过cherry-picking/rebase操作集成结果","为已完成的工作创建拉取请求(pull request)","报告清晰的工作流状态更新"],"ja":["着信する作業要求のトリアージ","ワーカーエージェントへのフォローアップタスクのディスパッチ","cherry-picking/rebase操作による結果の統合","完了した作業のプルリクエストの作成","明確なワークフローステータス更新の報告"],"ko":["들어오는 작업 요청 분류(Triage)","작업자 에이전트에게 후속 작업 디스패치","체리 픽(cherry-picking)/리베이스(rebase) 작업을 통한 결과 통합","완료된 작업에 대한 풀 리퀘스트(pull request) 생성","명확한 워크플로우 상태 업데이트 보고"],"es":["Clasificar solicitudes de trabajo entrantes","Despachar tareas de seguimiento a agentes trabajadores","Integrar resultados mediante operaciones de cherry-picking/rebase","Abrir pull requests para el trabajo completado","Reportar actualizaciones claras del estado del flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Trier les demandes de travail entrantes","Distribuer des tâches de suivi aux agents travailleurs","Intégrer les résultats via des opérations de cherry-picking/rebase","Ouvrir des pull requests pour le travail terminé","Rapporter des mises à jour claires sur l''état du flux de travail"],"de":["Eingehende Arbeitsanfragen priorisieren","Folgeaufgaben an Worker-Agents weiterleiten","Ergebnisse durch Cherry-Picking-/Rebase-Operationen integrieren","Pull Requests für abgeschlossene Arbeiten öffnen","Klare Statusupdates zum Workflow melden"],"pt":["Triar solicitações de trabalho recebidas","Despachar tarefas de acompanhamento para agentes trabalhadores","Integrar resultados através de operações de cherry-picking/rebase","Abrir pull requests para trabalhos concluídos","Relatar atualizações claras de status do fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Сортировка входящих рабочих запросов","Распределение последующих задач рабочим агентам","Интеграция результатов через операции cherry-picking/rebase","Открытие pull requests для завершенной работы","Предоставление четких обновлений статуса рабочего процесса"],"ar":["فرز طلبات العمل الواردة","إرسال مهام المتابعة إلى وكلاء العمال","دمج النتائج من خلال عمليات cherry-picking/rebase","فتح طلبات السحب للعمل المكتمل","الإبلاغ عن تحديثات واضحة لحالة سير العمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Cannot handle secrets in git or receipts","Prohibited from merging protected branches","Cannot claim completion with unresolved tasks"],"zh":["无法处理git中的密钥(secrets)或收据(receipts)","禁止合并受保护的分支","存在未解决任务时无法声明完成"],"ja":["git内のシークレットまたはレシートを処理できない","保護されたブランチのマージは禁止されている","未解決のタスクがある場合は完了を主張できない"],"ko":["git 내의 시크릿(secrets) 또는 영수증(receipts)을 처리할 수 없음","보호된 브랜치 병합이 금지됨","해결되지 않은 작업이 있을 경우 완료를 주장할 수 없음"],"es":["No puede manejar secrets en git o receipts","Tiene prohibido fusionar ramas protegidas","No puede declarar finalización con tareas sin resolver"],"fr":["Incapable de gérer les secrets dans git ou les reçus","Interdit de fusionner des branches protégées","Incapable de déclarer l''achèvement avec des tâches non résolues"],"de":["Kann keine Secrets in git oder Receipts verarbeiten","Darf geschützte Branches nicht mergen","Kann keine Fertigstellung mit ungelösten Aufgaben beanspruchen"],"pt":["Não pode lidar com segredos no git ou recibos","Proibido de fazer merge de branches protegidas","Não pode declarar conclusão com tarefas não resolvidas"],"ru":["Не может обрабатывать секреты в git или квитанции","Запрещено выполнять слияние защищенных веток","Не может объявлять о завершении при наличии нерешенных задач"],"ar":["لا يمكن التعامل مع الأسرار في git أو الإيصالات","ممنوع من دمج الفروع المحمية","لا يمكن المطالبة بالإكمال مع وجود مهام غير محلولة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"37c5ca274c790bdb15921eac96fbd6d45ae3236c322c06de900fe80ae15549c6","qualityScore":57}');
